{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0088a2b5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Modelled from dedicated control regions in data?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using methods that involve \"Modelled from dedicated control regions in data\":\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $W$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets (Z→νν) and W+jets backgrounds.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates ttbar (semileptonic/dileptonic), W+jets, and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, $Wt$ single-top, $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$, and \"Others\" minor backgrounds.\n- **2106.01676**: Uses Z+jets MC sample, estimates SM WZ (three real prompt leptons), ttbar, and Z+jets (FNP-lepton) backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets (primarily Z->tautau) and non-resonant WW diboson backgrounds.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $W{+}\\text{jets}$ and $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates t t̄ and W+jets backgrounds.\n- **2307.01094**: Estimates $WZ$ + jets background.\n\nThese analyses use various methods involving dedicated control regions in data to estimate the backgrounds. For example, some use control-region-based normalisation via simultaneous profile likelihood fit, others use direct MC simulation estimates, and some use data-driven normalisation methods.\n\nIf you need more details on specific methods or further information, please let me know.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Modelled from dedicated control regions in data", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.337}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_method", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 147, "error": null, "seconds": 0.071}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:others-minor", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:wjets", "hepkg:background:ww", "hepkg:background:www", "hepkg:background:wz-jets", "hepkg:background:wz", "hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:sample:zjets", "hepkg:background:zjets", "hepkg:background:z_jets", "hepkg:background:ttbar"], "predicate": "background_uses_method"}, "rows": 54, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}, {"round": 4, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:others-minor", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:wjets", "hepkg:background:ww", "hepkg:background:www", "hepkg:background:wz-jets", "hepkg:background:wz", "hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:sample:zjets", "hepkg:background:zjets", "hepkg:background:z_jets", "hepkg:background:ttbar"]}, "rows": 40, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs", "hepkg:background_method:cr_normalisation_fit", "hepkg:background_method:data-control-sample-normalization", "hepkg:background_method:data_driven_fake_factor", "hepkg:background_method:data_driven_nonprompt_control_sample", "hepkg:background_meth