{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-009c7aa6", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Signal region SR^h_1B (1ℓ selection, large χ̃2⁰-χ̃1⁰ mass splitting)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Signal region SR^h_1B (1ℓ selection, large χ̃2⁰-χ̃1⁰ mass splitting)\" or similar signal regions:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\n- **2008.05928**: Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in $pp$ Collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS Detector\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\, \\text{TeV}$ and $13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics including Higgs boson decays, supersymmetry searches, and measurements of", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Signal region SR^h_1B (1ℓ selection, large χ̃2⁰-χ̃1⁰ mass splitting)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.587}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 53, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c0021