{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-023db610", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss):\n\n- **2004.01678**: Preselection region (m_llj < 250 GeV)\n- **2006.05880**: Control regions CR^Z_ttZ and CR^Z_VV for multi-boson and ttZ background normalisation (3ℓ selection)\n- **2007.02873**: 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- **2009.14537**: Preselection region (opposite-charge same-flavor dilepton, Z-veto, low p_T^ll)\n- **2012.01581**: Common dijet/SV preselection region (Table 2) and Final signal region (Region H)\n- **2106.01676**: On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20) and Common baseline selection for three-lepton categories (3ℓA–3ℓF)\n- **2107.12553**: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6) and 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2110.11231**: Signal region (SR) for WZ trilepton production\n- **2112.00895**: SL channel selection, W->e nu decay (reconstructed) and SL channel selection, W->mu nu decay (reconstructed)\n- **2112.03161**: Dilepton (DL) channel signal region\n- **2209.07327**: Multilepton channel signal region\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2312.04450**: SR-2ℓ-5j2b\n- **2401.05299**: 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n- **2402.08486**: Detector-level dilepton ttbar signal region (baseline event selection) and Detector-level extra-jet definition region for N_jet measurement\n- **2404.06204**: Detector-level signal region for W -> e nu selection and Detector-level signal region for W -> mu nu selection\n\nThese analyses cover a wide range of final states and signal regions, all of which require Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss) as part of their definitions.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Missing transverse momentum", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.269}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 82, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:signal-regions", "hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdom-sr", "hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:three_lepton_baseline", "hepkg:object:CR-Z-VV", "hepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ", "hepkg:region:detector_sr_dilepton", "hepkg:region:detector_extra_jets", "hepkg:region:w-enu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:w-munu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:dl_search_region", "hepkg:region:hww_fiducial", "hepkg:region:htautau_fiducial", "hepkg:region:hmdy_cc_wlnu_fiducial", "hepkg:region:hinv_monojet", "hepkg:region:ml-sr", "hepkg:region:sr-wz", "hepkg:region:sl_electron", "hepkg:region:sl_muon", "hepkg:region:sr-2l-5j2b"]}, "rows": 31, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object