{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-037f94e9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 3-lepton WZ control region, 0 jets?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"3-lepton WZ control region, 0 jets\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{Te\\kern-1.00006ptV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( \\mathup{{{W}}}\\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( \\mathup{{{p}}}\\mathup{{{p}}} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( {{\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n\nThese analyses are the ones that define the specific region you asked about.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2007.02873", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "3-lepton WZ control region, 0 jets", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.449}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:0lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:0lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_mj", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-0jet-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-1jet-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz