{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-03c4939a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Missing transverse momentum?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object Missing Transverse Momentum:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV.\n- **2004.04545**: CP Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the \\(t\\bar{t}H\\) and \\(tH\\) Processes Using \\(H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma\\) with the ATLAS Detector.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2109.13808**: Constraints on Higgs boson properties using \\(WW^{*}(\\rightarrow e\\nu\\mu\\nu)jj\\) production in \\(36.1\\text{\\,}\\mathrm{fb}^{-1}\\) of \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}\\).\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV in the \\(H\\to\\gamma\\gamma\\) channel using \\(139\\) fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(pp\\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\(t\\bar{t}\\) production measured in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\;\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}Z\\) production in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}\\).\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\(W\\) and \\(Z\\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\) and 13  TeV.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}\\).\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}\\).\n- **2", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Missing transverse momentum", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.259}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 56, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c