{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-066278f7", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region CR_{b+j/b}^{ee}: 2-jet dielectron control region with at least one b-tagged jet?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \\( \\text{CR}_{b+j/b}^{ee} \\): 2-jet dielectron control region with at least one b-tagged jet:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\to b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2008.05928**: Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\( pp \\) Collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS Detector.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) and \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2511.11853**: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese analyses are the ones that define the specified region.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "CR_{b+j/b}^{ee}: 2-jet dielectron control region with at least one b-tagged jet", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.562}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "hepkg:result:1b05d75dca9cf140bac022d5", "hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2"]}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:1lep_cr_mj", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_emu", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-1jet-cr", "hepkg:region:CR_2j", "hepkg:region:CR_2j_ee", "hepkg:region:CR_b_ee", "hepkg:region:CR_b_j_b_ee", "hepkg:region:CR_j", "hepkg:region:CR_j_ee", "hepkg:region:SR_b", "hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b", "hepkg:region:cr-1mu", "hepkg:region:cr-2body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-2lep", "hepkg:region:cr-3b