 analyses that measured |Δφ| between the leading extra light jet and the softest b jet. These analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson production, top quark pair production, and \\(t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}\\) production. For more detailed information on any specific analysis or observable, please let me know.\n\nAnswerable: True\nReason: answered", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2504.13081"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "|Δφ| between leading extra light jet and softest b jet", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 48, "error": null, "seconds": 0.459}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:HT_light", "hepkg:observable:R_b_over_j", "hepkg:observable:R_c_over_b", "hepkg:observable:abs_deta_jj", "hepkg:observable:b-jet-fraction", "hepkg:observable:deltaR_bb_avg", "hepkg:observable:deltaR_bbextra", "hepkg:observable:delta_phi_ljextra_bsoft", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-pt-leading-jet", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_njet", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_jet", "hepkg:observable:dphi_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:eta_b1_add", "hepkg:observable:eta_b1_extra", "hepkg:observable:eta_b2_extra", "hepkg:observable:eta_b3", "hepkg:observable:eta_b4", "hepkg:observable:eta_bbextra", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_w", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_wminus", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_wplus", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_z", "hepkg:observable:integrated-xsec-ratio", "hepkg:observable:light_jet_mistag_rate", "hepkg:observable:m_bbextra", "hepkg:observable:m_ttbar_vs_dphi_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:n_b", "hepkg:observa