{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-06798d27", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Higgs boson branching fraction to invisible final states (B_inv)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records several results that measure the Higgs boson branching fraction to invisible final states (B_inv). Here are the specific results and the papers they appear in:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Result ID: `hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450`\n   - Paper: [Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.04405)\n\n2. **Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result**:\n   - Result ID: `hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3`\n   - Paper: [Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result] (Not directly linked to a specific arXiv ID in the graph)\n\n3. **Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result**:\n   - Result ID: `hepkg:result:combined-run3`\n   - Paper: [Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result] (Not directly linked to a specific arXiv ID in the graph)\n\n4. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Result ID: `hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556`\n   - Paper: [Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector](https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.04405)\n\n5. **Coupling modifier ratio fit**:\n   - Result ID: `hepkg:result:coupling_modifier_ratios`\n   - Paper: [Coupling modifier ratio fit] (Not directly linked to a specific arXiv ID in the graph)\n\n6. **Differential branching fraction measurement of \\( B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ \\mu^+ \\mu^- \\) across 15 \\( q^2 \\) bins**:\n   - Result ID: `hepkg:result:diff_bf_bp_k_mumu`\n   - Paper: [Differential branching fraction measurement of \\( B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ \\mu^+ \\mu^- \\) across 15 \\( q^2 \\) bins] (Not directly linked to a specific arXiv ID in the graph)\n\n7. **Effective coupling modifier fit assuming no additional BSM decays**:\n   - Result ID: `hepkg:result:coupling_effective_bsm0`\n   - Paper: [Effective coupling modifier fit assuming no additional BSM decays] (Not directly linked to a specific arXiv ID in the graph)\n\n8. **Effective coupling modifier fit with \\( B_{\\text{inv}} \\), \\( B_{\\text{undet}} \\) floating and \\( |\\kappa_V| \\leq 1 \\) constraint**:\n   - Result ID: `hepkg:result:coupling_effective_binv_kv1`\n   - Paper: [Effective coupling modifier fit with \\( B_{\\text{inv}} \\), \\( B_{\\text{undet}} \\) floating and \\( |\\kappa_V| \\leq 1 \\) constraint] (Not directly linked to a specific arXiv ID in the graph)\n\n9. **Effective coupling modifier fit with off-shell \\( H \\rightarrow ZZ \\rightarrow", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2401.07090", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Higgs boson branching fraction to invisible final states", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.344}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.063}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_set": "set_1", "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 0, 