{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-06f0fe7f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Data-to-simulation scale factor derived in a control region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate backgrounds using a data-to-simulation scale factor derived in a control region:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $W$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2007.02873**: Estimates Z+jets background.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets (Z→νν) and W+jets backgrounds.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates ttbar (semileptonic/dileptonic), W+jets, and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, $Wt$ single-top, $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$, and \"Others\" minor background categories ($VVV$, $t\\bar{t}t$, $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $t\\bar{t}WW$, $t\\bar{t}WZ$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $tZ$).\n- **2106.01676**: Estimates SM WZ, ttbar, and Z+jets (FNP-lepton) backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets and non-resonant WW diboson backgrounds.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $W{+}\\text{jets}$ and $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, W+jets, and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2307.01094**: Estimates $WZ$ + jets background.\n\nThese analyses use various data-to-simulation scale factors derived in control regions to estimate different background contributions.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225