{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0840aa89", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Higgs boson branching fraction to undetected final states (B_undet)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses have measured the Higgs boson branching fraction to undetected final states (B_undet):\n\n1. **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n2. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n3. **2401.07090**: Differential branching fraction measurement of \\( B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ \\mu^+ \\mu^- \\) across 15 \\( q^2 \\) bins.\n4. **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n5. **2602.18611**: Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength measurement.\n6. **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n7. **2604.27044**: Combined Run 3 resolved+merged \\( HH \\rightarrow 4b \\) result.\n8. **2604.27044**: Combined Run 2 + Run 3 \\( HH \\rightarrow 4b \\) result.\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics related to Higgs boson properties and interactions, including branching fractions and effective coupling modifiers.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2401.07090", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "