{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0974a9b1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample ttH POWHEG 2.0 NLO signal MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"ttH POWHEG 2.0 NLO signal MC sample\":\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2405.18661**: \"CMS ttbar inclusive cross section measurement in the e-mu final state at 13 TeV\"\n- **2405.18661**: \"CMS H->gamma gamma fiducial cross section measurement\"\n- **2405.18661**: \"CMS H->ZZ->4l fiducial cross section measurement\"\n- **2405.18661**: \"CMS H->tau tau fiducial cross section measurement\"\n- **2405.18661**: \"CMS H->WW fiducial cross section measurement\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n- **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ttH POWHEG 2.0 NLO signal MC sample", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.569}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 84, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:h_ww_fiducial_xsec", "hepkg:result:h_zz4l_fiducial_xsec", "hepkg:result:h_gammagamma_fiducial_xsec", "hepkg:result:h_tautau_fiducial_xsec", "hepkg:result:ttbar_emu_xsec_13tev", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19"]}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:bbh-powheg", "hepkg:sample:bbh-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:bbh_jhugen", "hepkg:sample:ggf-powheg-nnlops", "hepkg:sample:ggf_hh_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ggh_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ggh_vbf_tth_signal_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:hh-ggf-nlo-powheg", "hepkg:sample:hh-vbf-lo-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:higgs_ggf_signal_powheg_nnlops", "hepkg:sample:higgs_signal_powheg", "hepkg:sample:qqzz_powheg", "hepkg:sample:signal_mc_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:signal_mc_powheg", "hepkg:sample:signal_