{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0a2e50b3", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $WZ$ background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the $WZ$ background:\n\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H \\to b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential $WZ$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $W$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\to t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of $W$ and $Z$ boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\, \\text{TeV}$ and $13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS $t\\bar{t}Z$ associated production cross section measurement.\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and $13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2510.07527**: HH->multilepton analysis result.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state.\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including measurements of production cross sections, studies of Higgs boson decays, and investigations of new phenomena.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "WZ", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.294}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 45, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339"]}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:diboson_vv", "hepkg:background:multiboson-3l", "hepkg:background:multiboson_prompt", "hepkg:background:multilepton_diboson", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_wz_ttz", "hepkg:background:other-sm-minor", "hepkg:background:others-minor", "hepkg:background:ttbarZ", "hepkg:background:twz", "hepkg:background:w-boson", "hepkg:background:wz", "hepkg:background:wz-ewk", "hepkg:background:wz-jets", "hepkg:background:wz-plus-jets", "hepkg:background:wz-vgamma-multiboson", "hepkg:background:wz_prompt", "hepkg:background:zz", "hepkg:background:zz_h_prompt"]}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:diboson_vv", "hepkg:background:multiboson-3l", "hepkg:background:multiboson_prompt", "hepkg:background:multilepton_diboson", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_wz_ttz", "hepkg:background:other-sm-minor", "hepkg:background:others-minor", "hepkg:background:ttbarZ", "hepkg:background:twz", "hepkg:background:w-boson", "hepkg:background:wz", "hepkg:background:wz-ewk", "hepkg:background:wz-jets", "hepkg:background:wz-plus-jets", "hepkg:background:wz-vgamma-multiboson", "hepkg:background:wz_prompt", "hepkg:background:zz", "hepkg:background:zz_h_prompt", "hepkg:result:145b646dbebeacbefd96614b", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b", "hepkg:result:33a6f7b6bd891f45d2688022", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:46ee77edd095181b02474a60", "hepkg:result:4fc18dcf1fe256e1dbb021d9", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:8082f0673970bd836137f703", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f7