{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0c2e0a7a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Misidentified-lepton background (bbWW lvqq/2l2nu)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background \"Misidentified-lepton background (bbWW lvqq/2l2nu)\" or related backgrounds:\n\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2405.18661**: CMS ttbar+Z0 (ttZ) associated production cross section measurement\n- **2405.18661**: CMS ttbar+W (ttW) associated production cross section measurement\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bbWW, WW->lvqq/2l2nu analysis result\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result\n- **2510.07527**: HH->multilepton analysis result\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bbZZ(4l) analysis result\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson pair production, multilepton probes, and various cross-section measurements. Each of these papers includes estimates of the misidentified-lepton background or related backgrounds.\n\nAnswered based on the graph data.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Misidentified-lepton background (bbWW lvqq/2l2nu)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.499}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 109, "error": null, "seconds": 0.055}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:ttw_measurement", "hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:bbww_lvqq_2l2nu", "hepkg:result:bbzz", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba06