{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0f8f74c0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample $Wt$ simulated sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the $Wt$ simulated sample:\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2102.01444**: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2106.01676**: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2106.14246**: Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2107.12553**: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\mathup{W}$ bosons using 137 $\\, \\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2112.03161**: Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\mathup{W}$ and $\\mathup{Z}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{*}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the $Wt$ simulated sample according to the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2402.08486", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Wt", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 31, "error": null, "seconds": 0.272}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 53, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:4fc18dcf1fe256e1dbb021d9", "hepkg:result:145b646dbebeacbefd96614b", "hepkg:result:8082f0673970bd836137f703", "hepkg:result:faf187c3052688d9764c6e95", "hepkg:result:33a6f7b6bd891f45d2688022"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:ewk_boson_top_mg5nlo", "hepkg:sample:gtt-signal", "hepkg:sample:qq-wh", "hepkg:sample:single-top-mc", "hepkg:sample:single-top-wt", "hepkg:sample:single_top_tw", "hepkg:sample:single_top_wt", "hepkg:sample:singletop-mc", "hepkg:sample:singletop-swt-channel", "hepkg:sample:singletop-wt-mc", "hepkg:sample:singletop-wt-powheg", "hepkg:sample:tW", "hepkg:sample:tWZ", "hepkg:sample:tWZ-mc", "hepkg:sample:tZ-tttt-ttt-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttW", "hepkg:sample