{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0fb08f63", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese analyses are the ones that explicitly define the region \"1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)\".\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses define the region '1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)':\\n\\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\\\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV.\\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\\\) and \\( ZH \\\\) production in the \\( H \\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b} \\\\) decay channel in \\( pp \\\\) collisions at \\( 13 \\\\, \\\\text{TeV} \\\\) with the ATLAS detector.\\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\, \\\\text{TeV} \\\\).\\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\\\bar{t}Z \\\\) production in \\( pp \\\\) collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\\\ast} \\\\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2102.01444", "2106.14246", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2312.04450", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.508}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 55, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg: