{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0fb29642", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background ttbar background (bbbb boosted)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background for the \\( t\\bar{t} \\) background (bbbb boosted):\n\n1. **CMS four top quark (\\( t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t} \\)) production measurement** (Paper: [2405.18661](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.18661))\n2. **CMS \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) associated production cross section measurement** (Paper: [2405.18661](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.18661))\n3. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV** (Paper: [2602.18611](https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.18611))\n4. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector** (Paper: [2111.08340](https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.08340))\n5. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (Paper: [2205.05120](https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.05120))\n6. **Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H \\to \\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment** (Paper: [2207.00348](https://arxiv.org/abs/2207.00348))\n7. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Paper: [2208.12095](https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.12095))\n8. **HH \\(\\rightarrow\\) bb tautau analysis result** (Paper: [2510.07527](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.07527))\n9. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state** (Paper: [2604.27044](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.27044))\n10. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations** (Paper: [2312.04450](https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.04450))\n11. **Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV** (Paper: [2408.03744](https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.03744))\n12. **Measurement of the production cross section", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ttbar background (bbbb boosted)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "seconds": 0.304}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 94, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:fourtop_measurement", "hepkg:result:ttw_measurement", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "he