{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-1002d919", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Powheg+Pythia 8.230 (nominal $t\\bar t$ generator)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample Powheg+Pythia 8.230 (nominal \\( t\\bar{t} \\) generator):\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the \\( t\\bar{t}H \\) and \\( tH \\) Processes Using \\( H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma \\) with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n3. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n4. **2303.15340**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n5. **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\"\n6. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n7. **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\"\n8. **2405.18661**: \"CMS W and Z boson inclusive/fiducial/ratio cross section measurements (5, 7, 8, 13 TeV)\"\n9. **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\"\n\nThese analyses utilized the Powheg+Pythia 8.230 sample for various studies involving top quark production and interactions.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2112.03161", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Powheg+Pythia 8.230", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.353}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 79, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:w_z_inclusive_fiducial_xsec", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c"]}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:bbh-powheg", "hepkg:sample:diboson-pythia8", "hepkg:sample:diboson_alt_powheg_pythia8", "hepkg:sample:diboson_powheg_pythia8210", "hepkg:sample:diboson_pythia8", "hepkg:sample:gamma_jet_jetjet_pythia", "hepkg:sample:ggf-powheg-nnlops", "hepkg:sample:ggf_higgs", "hepkg:sample:ggf_vbf_vh_higgs", "hepkg:sample:pileup-pythia", "hepkg:sample:powheg-pythia8-signal", "hepkg:sample:powheg-pythia8-top", "hepkg:sample:signal_mc_powheg", "hepkg:sample:single-top-powheg", "hepkg:sample:singletop-powheg", "hepkg:sample:singletop-powheg-pythia", "hepkg:sample:singletop-swt-channel", "hepkg:sa