{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-1233a92a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Ratio of fiducial cross sections extrapolated to the CMS fiducial phase space?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the \"Ratio of fiducial cross sections extrapolated to the CMS fiducial phase space\":\n\n- **2110.11231**: Fiducial WZ production cross section measurement (combined flavour categories)\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Fiducial \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) cross-section measurement result\n- **2404.06204**: Measurement of W+/W- normalised \\( p_T \\) ratio at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2404.06204**: Measurement of W(+/-)/Z normalised \\( p_T \\) ratio at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2404.06204**: Measurement of W(+/-)/Z normalised \\( p_T \\) ratio at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2404.06204**: Integrated fiducial cross-section measurement for W-, W+ and Z production at 5.02 and 13 TeV (Table 3)\n- **2404.06204**: Integrated fiducial cross-section ratios between processes at fixed \\( \\sqrt{s} \\) (Table 5)\n- **2404.06204**: Fiducial cross sections extrapolated to CMS phase space (Table 11)\n- **2404.06204**: Fiducial cross-section ratios extrapolated to CMS phase space (T