{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-135db430", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 3ℓA search regions, M_ll in Z window (A23–A64)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"3ℓA search regions, M_ll in Z window (A23–A64)\":\n\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and \\( 13 \\) TeV\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics including Higgs boson production, top quark production, and searches for new physics.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.14537", "2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "3ℓA search regions, M_ll in Z window (A23–A64)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.51}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 62, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc