{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-16c2a9b8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Global Higgs boson signal strength modifier μ = σB(H→WW)/σB(H→WW)_SM?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the global Higgs boson signal strength modifier \\( \\mu = \\sigma B(H \\to WW) / \\sigma B(H \\to WW)_{\\text{SM}} \\):\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H \\to \\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H \\to b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n3. **2504.13081**: \"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n4. **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n5. **2602.18611**: \"Effective coupling modifier fit assuming no additional BSM decays\"\n6. **2602.18611**: \"Effective coupling modifier fit with $B_{\\text{inv}}$, $B_{\\text{undet}}$ floating and $|\\kappa_V| \\leq 1$ constraint\"\n7. **2602.18611**: \"Coupling modifier ratio fit\"\n8. **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n9. **2604.27044**: \"Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result\"\n10. **2604.27044**: \"Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of analyses related to the measurement of the global Higgs boson signal strength modifier.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2