, "partner", "penalty", "phenomena", "photon", "physics", "plus", "point", "polarisation-coupling", "polarization", "probe", "probes", "processes", "produced", "production", "products", "programme", "properties", "proton", "proton-proton", "ptv", "qcd", "quark", "quarks", "reclustered", "reconstructed", "relaxed", "report", "resonance", "resonances", "result", "result_defines_object", "results", "rightarrow", "same-flavor", "same-sign", "scalar", "scenarios", "search", "searches", "section", "sections", "signals", "simultaneous", "single", "sleptons", "small-r", "small-radius", "soft", "spectra", "spin-correlation", "sqrt", "squarks", "srd", "stage", "stairway", "state", "states", "stxs", "supersymmetric", "supersymmetry", "tau", "tau_h", "tev", "text", "the", "theory", "three", "tight", "top", "total", "track-jet", "transverse", "triple", "two", "using", "vbf", "vector", "vector-like", "via", "weak", "with", "working", "yukawa"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 4, "prompt_tokens": 23600, "completion_tokens": 705, "rounds": 4, "seconds": 32.038749733008444, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 32.038749733008444, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 24305.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "entity_retrieved": 1.0, "entities_seen": 133.0, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 133.0, "evidence_quotes": 154.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-1873a430", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Reconstructed muon?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define regions that require a reconstructed muon:\n\n1. **\"Had\" region**:\n   - Requires a lepton (electron or muon).\n   - Requires a jet.\n   - Requires a b-tagged jet.\n\n2. **\"Lep\" region**:\n   - Requires a lepton (electron or muon).\n\n3. **$e\\mu$ fiducial phase-space region (particle level)**:\n   - Requires a particle-level (dressed) muon.\n\n4. **$t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)**:\n   - Requires an isolated muon with $p_T > 52.5 \\, \\text{GeV}$.\n   - Requires a J_b jet (b-quark proxy large-R jet in CR_ttbar).\n   - Requires a J_t jet (hadronic top-quark proxy large-R jet in CR_ttbar).\n\n5. **1-lepton channel signal region (SR)**:\n   - Requires a muon with $p_T > 25 \\, \\text{GeV}$ and tight quality.\n   - Requires an electron with $p_T > 27 \\, \\text{GeV}$ and tight quality.\n\n6. **1L, 0 S-jet category**:\n   - Requires a muon with $p_T > 25 \\, \\text{GeV}$ and tight quality.\n   - Requires an electron with $p_T > 27 \\, \\text{GeV}$ and tight quality.\n   - Requires missing transverse momentum ($p_T^{\\text{miss}} > 60 \\, \\text{GeV}$).\n   - Requires $\\leq 1$ jet with $p_T > 40 \\, \\text{GeV}$.\n\n7. **2-lepton channel eμ top control region (eμ-CR)**:\n   - Requires a reconstructed electron.\n   - Requires a reconstructed muon.\n\n8. **2-lepton channel signal region (SR)**:\n   - Requires a muon with opposite-sign and same-flavour, leading $p_T > 27 \\, \\text{GeV}$ and loose quality.\n   - Requires an electron with opposite-sign and same-flavour, leading $p_T > 27 \\, \\text{GeV}$ and loose quality.\n\n9. **2L, 0 S-jet category**:\n   - Requires a muon with $p_T > 25 \\, \\text{GeV}$ and tight quality.\n   - Requires an electron with $p_T > 27 \\, \\text{GeV}$ and tight quality.\n   - Requires missing transverse momentum ($p_T^{\\text{miss}} > 60 \\, \\text{GeV}$).\n   - Requires $\\leq 1$ jet with $p_T > 40 \\, \\text{GeV}$.\n\n10. **2ℓ SS Fiducial Region**:\n    - Requires a reconstructed electron.\n    - Requires a reconstructed muon.\n\n11. **2ℓ SS Signal Region**:\n    - Requires a reconstructed electron.\n    - Requires a reconstructed muon.\n\n12. **2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions**:\n    - Requires a reconstructed electron.\n\n13. **2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions**:\n    - Requires a reconstructed muon.\n\n14. **2ℓ-eμ-5j2b (data-driven ttbar control region)**:\n    - Requires a reconstructed electron.\n    - Requires a reconstructed muon.\n\n15. **2ℓ-eμ-6j1b (data-driven ttbar control region)**:\n    - Requires a reconstructed electron.\n    - Requires a reconstructed muon.\n\n16. **2ℓ-eμ-6j2b (data-driven", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Reconstructed muon", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 42, "erro