{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-19932972", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample $Z/\\gamma^{*}$ (Z+jets) simulated sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample $Z/\\gamma^{*}$ (Z+jets) simulated sample:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a $Z$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2004.04545**: $CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of $t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13 TeV.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Z/gamma* (Z+jets) simulated sample", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.403}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 89, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:background-zjets", "hepkg:sample:diboson-mc", "hepkg:sample:diboson_mc", "hepkg:sample:dyjets-mc", "hepkg:sample:gamma-jets-bkg-mc", "hepkg:sample:gamma-jets-sherpa",