{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-1a50fd2c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample T2bW (top squark pair production, decay via intermediate chargino to W boson)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following papers used samples that could include the T2bW sample (top squark pair production, decay via intermediate chargino to W boson):\n\n1. **Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or Z boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Paper ID: `2006.05880`\n   - [Link to the paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.05880)\n\n2. **Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Paper ID: `2106.01676`\n   - [Link to the paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.01676)\n\n3. **Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Paper ID: `2106.14246`\n   - [Link to the paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.14246)\n\n4. **General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Paper ID: `2508.13900`\n   - [Link to the paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.13900)\n\nTo confirm if the T2bW sample was specifically used in these analyses, you can review the detailed content of these papers. The graph does not explicitly list the T2bW sample, but these papers are part of searches for supersymmetric particles, which could include the T2bW sample.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The graph does not explicitly list a sample named 'T2bW' (top squark pair production, decay via intermediate chargino to W boson). However, the following papers used samples that could include the T2bW sample:\\n\\n1. **Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or Z boson using 139 fb\\\\(^{-1}\\\\) of \\( pp \\\\) collision data at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: `2006.05880`)\\n2. **Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV \\( pp \\\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: `2106.01676`)\\n3. **Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\, \\\\text{TeV} \\\\)** (Paper ID: `2106.14246`)\\n4. **General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\, \\\\text{TeV} \\\\)** (Paper ID: `2508.13900`)\\n\\nTo confirm if the T2bW sample was specifically used, you can review the detailed content of these papers.\", \"answerable\": true,", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2402.08486", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2509.22535"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "T2bW", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.258}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 33, "error": null, "seconds": 0.03}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:145b646dbebeacbefd96614b", "hepkg:result:8082f0673970bd836137f703", "hepkg:result:d5288b5bc0407b0b2005d131"]}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:single_top_tw", "hepkg:sample:single_top_tw_powheg", 