{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-1ead54da", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions\":\n\n1. **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n2. **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n3. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n4. **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n5. **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n6. **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n7. **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n8. **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese analyses are the ones that define the specified control region.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.484}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 55, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e"]}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:0lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:0lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-fiducial", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-sr", "hepkg:region:2l-tt-e-cr", "hepkg:region:2l-tt-mu-cr", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_emu", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hbb", "hepkg:region:bbww_2l", "hepkg:region:cr-1mu", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-5j2b", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-6j1b", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-6j2b", "hepkg:region:cr-2lep", "hepkg:region:cr-fnp", "hepkg:region:cr-t", "hepkg:region:cr-top", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbar-mu", "hepkg:region:cr_topquark_nonvbf_ltau_lprime",