{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-1f46a0bb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background QCD multijet background (bbbb boosted)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the QCD multijet background (bbbb boosted):\n\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS four top quark (tttt) production measurement.\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bb tautau analysis result.\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bb gamgam analysis result.\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result.\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( \\mathup{{{b}}} \\) final state.\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson production, top quark production, and various final states involving multiple b-quarks.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "QCD multijet background (bbbb boosted)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.326}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 138, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:fourtop_measurement", "hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbgamgam", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.016}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_ttbar", "hepkg:background:bbbb_resolved_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbgamgam_continuum", "hepkg:background:bbtautau_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbww4q_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbww4q_top_vector_boson", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:dy_background", "hepkg:background:ew-singlelepton", "hepkg:background:fnp", "hepkg:background:fourtop_backgrounds", "hepkg:backgr