ation.\n- **$tZq$ background**: Uses methods involving Monte Carlo simulation.\n\nSince the graph does not record the specific results that estimate these backgrounds, I cannot provide a list of analyses. However, the information above indicates that these backgrounds are commonly estimated using Monte Carlo simulation methods in the analyses recorded in the graph.\n\nAnswer: The graph does not record which specific analyses estimate these backgrounds using Monte Carlo simulation methods. However, it is known that these backgrounds are estimated using such methods in various analyses. \n\n[Not in graph]", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Background modelled using MC simulation", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.324}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_method", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 190, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:others-minor", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:vvv", "hepkg:background:wjets", "hepkg:background:ww", "hepkg:background:wz", "hepkg:background:wz-plus-jets", "hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:z-plus-jets", "hepk