{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-24f1303d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Companion muon (non-triggering muon in B+ -> K+ mu+ mu- candidate)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses define a region requiring a Companion muon (non-triggering muon in B+ -> K+ mu+ mu- candidate):\\n\\n- 2001.06899: W+jets validation sample for light-jet M_SV template (muon+>=1 jet)\\n- 2009.04363: WH leptonic category region (mu-mu-mu and mu-mu-e subchannels)\\n- 2112.00895: SL channel selection, W->mu nu decay (reconstructed)\\n- 2112.03161: Non-top control region (non-top CR)\\n- 2202.08676: LQ-M leptoquark BDT (medium mass range)\\n- 2208.12095: Single-lepton resolved, 1$b$-tag-exclusive region\\n- 2208.12095: Single-lepton resolved, 2$b$-tag-inclusive region\\n- 2208.12095: Single-lepton boosted, 1$b$-tag-exclusive region\\n- 2208.12095: Single-lepton boosted, 2$b$-tag-inclusive region\\n- 2208.12095: Dilepton $e\\\\mu$, 1$b$-tag-exclusive region\\n- 2208.12095: Dilepton $e\\\\mu$, 2$b$-tag-inclusive region\\n- 2208.12095: Dilepton $ee+\\\\mu\\\\mu$, 1$b$-tag-exclusive region\\n- 2208.12095: Dilepton $ee+\\\\mu\\\\mu$, 2$b$-tag-inclusive region\\n- 2303.15340: Opposite-sign $e\\\\mu$ + exactly one $b$-tagged jet region (reconstructed level)\\n- 2303.15340: Opposite-sign $e\\\\mu$ + exactly two $b$-tagged jets region (reconstructed level)\\n- 2304.08962: Fake-muon control region for Others background\\n- 2308.02285: Baseline W+jet reconstructed-level selection, muon channel\\n- 2312.04450: CR-ttbar-mu (trilepton fake-lepton control region, muon)\\n- 2401.05299: 2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions\\n- 2401.07090: Low-mass sideband, muon channel (4.90<m(K mu mu)<5.07 GeV)\\n- 2401.07090: Muon channel baseline preselection (B+ mass 5.0-5.6 GeV, prior to q^2 binning)\\n- 2404.06204: Detector-level signal region for W -> mu nu selection\\n- 2404.06204: Z -> mu mu multijet control region C (same-charge muon pairs, pT>20 GeV)\\n- 2407.10549: Single-muon control region (1$\\\\mu$-CR)\\n- 2503.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Companion muon (non-triggering muon in B+ -> K+ mu+ mu- candidate)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 56, "error": null, "seconds": 0.471}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 584, "error": null, "seconds": 0.071}, {"round": 3, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Companion muon (non-triggering muon in B+ -> K+ mu+ mu- candidate)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 26, "error": null, "seconds": 0.465}, {"round": 4, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:low_mass_sb_muon", "hepkg:region:2l-tt-mu-cr", "hepkg:region:preselection_muon", "hepkg:region:z-mj-region-c-muon", "hepkg:region:cr-1mu", "hepkg:region:dl_eeMumu_1b_excl", "hepkg:region:wh-leptonic", "hepkg:re