iggs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2304.08962: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2009.14537", "2012.01581", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Analysis Region (AR): D_ttX > 0.6 with ttbar+light suppression cut", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.46}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 49, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:61bead068d7011cdb8e37e4c", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:9d25a