{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-27e44ae9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Anti-tagged candidate jet?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring an \"Anti-tagged candidate jet\":\n\n- **2004.01678**: Signal Region (SR)\n- **2004.04545**: \"Had\" region\n- **2007.02873**: \n  - 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)\n  - 2-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 2-lepton channel eμ top control region (eμ-CR)\n- **2012.01581**: Final signal region (Region H)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)\n- **2107.12553**: 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2111.08340**: $t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)\n- **2202.08676**: \n  - 2L2T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, >=2 h candidates)\n  - 2L1T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, exactly 1 h candidate)\n  - 1L3T channel (exactly 1 light lepton, >=3 h candidates)\n  - 1L2T channel (exactly 1 light lepton, exactly 2 h candidates)\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2401.05299**: \n  - 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n  - 2ℓ SS Fiducial Region\n- **2506.13565**: 1 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ)\n- **2508.13900**: 0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)\n\nThese analyses are the ones that define regions requiring an \"Anti-tagged candidate jet\" based on the information in the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "21