{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-27fbf8fd", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $VVV$ background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the $VVV$ background:\n\n- **2012.03799**: Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\ \\mathrm{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2102.01444**: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$.\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ TeV and $13$ TeV.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{*}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2506.13565**: Search for nonresonant new physics signals in high-mass dilepton events produced in association with $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ -tagged jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$.\n- **2511.11853**: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$.\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text", "answered": true, "papers": ["2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "VVV", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.263}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 31, "error": null, "seconds": 0.028}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "hepkg:resul