{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-29d0bf45", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background ttbar+V and ttbar+jets related backgrounds in four top quark analyses?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background from \\( t\\bar{t}+V \\) and \\( t\\bar{t}+\\text{jets} \\) in four top quark analyses:\n\n1. **CMS four top quark (tttt) production measurement** (Paper: [2405.18661](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.18661))\n2. **Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Paper: [2004.14060](https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.14060))\n3. **Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Paper: [2012.03799](https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.03799))\n\nThese analyses are part of the broader set of papers that estimate the specified backgrounds. The graph does not record any other four top quark analyses that specifically estimate these backgrounds.\n\nAnswering your question based on the available data in the graph, the above analyses are the ones that estimate the \\( t\\bar{t}+V \\) and \\( t\\bar{t}+\\text{jets} \\) backgrounds in the context of four top quark studies.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate the background from \\( t\\\\bar{t}+V \\\\) and \\( t\\\\bar{t}+\\\\text{jets} \\\\) in four top quark analyses:\\n\\n1. **CMS four top quark (tttt) production measurement** (Paper: [2405.18661](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.18661))\\n2. **Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\\\bar{t} \\\\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Paper: [2004.14060](https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.14060))\\n3. **Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\\\) collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Paper: [2012.03799](https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.03799))\\n\\nThese analyses are part of the broader set of papers that estimate the specified backgrounds. The graph does not record any other four top quark analyses that specifically estimate these backgrounds.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2206.09466", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2308.02285", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ttbar+V ttbar+jets", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.311}, {"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "four top quark", "kind": "result"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.344}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 31, "error": null, "seconds": 0.03}, {"round": 2, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:fourtop_yt_limit", "hepkg:result:fourtop_measurement", "hepkg:result:ttbar_hhat_limit", "hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b", "hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:vtb_measurement", "hepkg:result:ae72705e5773a32c5f251172", "hepkg:result:schannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe"]}, "rows": 10, "er