{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-2ba0dd08", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring $b$-tagged track-jet?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring a $b$-tagged track-jet:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Signal Region (SR)\n- **2004.04545**: \"Had\" region\n- **2007.02873**: \n  - 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)\n  - 2-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- **2012.01581**: Final signal region (Region H)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)\n- **2107.12553**: 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2111.08340**: $t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2401.05299**: \n  - 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n  - 2ℓ SS Fiducial Region\n  - 2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions\n- **2506.13565**: 1 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ)\n- **2508.13900**: \n  - 0L, 0 S-jet category\n  - 0L, 1 S-jet category\n  - 0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)\n  - 1L, 0 S-jet category\n  - 1L, 1 S-jet category\n  - 2L, 0 S-jet category\n\nThese regions require various $b$-tagged jets with different criteria, such as the number of jets, their transverse momentum, and other selection requirements. Each analysis uses these regions to define specific signal or control regions for their studies.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "21