{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-2c98dd72", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the generator ewpd4lhc?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The generator \"ewpd4lhc\" was used in the following analyses, as reported in these papers:\n\n1. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark** (arXiv: 2604.21670)\n2. **Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector** (arXiv: 2007.02873)\n3. **Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS** (arXiv: 2009.14537)\n4. **Search for invisible decays of the Higgs boson produced via vector boson fusion in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (arXiv: 2201.11585)\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the generator \"ewpd4lhc\".\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The generator 'ewpd4lhc' was used in the following analyses, as reported in these papers:\\n\\n1. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark** (arXiv: 2604.21670)\\n2. **Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b} \\\\) decay channel in \\( pp \\\\) collisions at \\( 13\\\\, \\\\text{TeV} \\\\) with the ATLAS detector** (arXiv: 2007.02873)\\n3. **Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS** (arXiv: 2009.14537)\\n4. **Search for invisible decays of the Higgs boson produced via vector boson fusion in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\, \\\\text{TeV} \\\\)** (arXiv: 2201.11585)\\n\\nThese are the distinct papers that used the generator 'ewpd4lhc'.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873", "2009.14537", "2201.11585", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ewpd4lhc", "kind": "generator"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.309}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "sample_uses_generator", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_ids": ["hepkg:sample:wt_alt_ps", "hepkg:sample:diboson_alt_powheg_herwigpp", "hepkg:sample:ewpo_smeft_prediction", "hepkg:sample:mc-single-dissociative-signal", "hepkg:sample:ww_powheg"]}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.017}, {"round": 4, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12", "hepkg:result:327a2c56f1d09ad122ec20c4"]}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:generator:ewpd4lhc", "hepkg:generator:lpair4.0", "hepkg:generator:powheg_herwigpp", "hepkg:generator:powheg_unspecified_ww"]}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:generator:ewpd4lhc", "hepkg:generator:lpair4.0", "hepkg:generator:powheg_herwigpp", "hepkg:generator:powheg_unspecified_ww", "hepkg:result:327a2c56f1d09ad122ec20c4", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12", "hepkg:sample:diboson_alt_powheg_herwigpp", "hepkg:sample:ewpo_smeft_prediction", "hepkg:sample:mc-single-dissociative-signal", "hepkg:sample:wt_alt_ps", "hepkg:sample:ww_powheg"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1100b9451384f7e9b8d5d276", "hepkg:evidence:14c059828b26fbb5e478e15d", "hepkg:evidence:2e3ceb67c5f885d94f63217d", "h