{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-2d8197a8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Reconstructed additional (extra) jet not from top decay?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring a Reconstructed additional (extra) jet not from top decay:\n\n- **\"Had\" region**: Requires 1 lepton (electron or muon) and 2 jets, with additional jets beyond the required b-tagged jet.\n- **\"Lep\" region**: Requires 1 lepton (electron or muon) and 2 jets, with additional jets beyond the required b-tagged jet.\n- **$t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)**: Requires 2 b-tagged jets, a J_b jet (b-quark proxy large-R jet), and a J_t jet (hadronic top-quark proxy large-R jet).\n- **0-lepton channel signal region (SR)**: Requires 2 b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum (p_T^V proxy in 0-lepton channel).\n- **0L, 0 S-jet category**: Requires 1 secondary vertex (SV).\n- **0L, 1 S-jet category**: Requires 1 secondary vertex (SV).\n- **1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)**: Requires 2 b-tagged jets.\n- **1-lepton channel signal region (SR)**: Requires 1 lepton (electron or muon), 2 b-tagged jets, and 1 secondary vertex (SV).\n- **1L, 0 S-jet category**: Requires 1 lepton (electron or muon) and 1 secondary vertex (SV).\n- **1L, 1 S-jet category**: Requires 1 secondary vertex (SV).\n- **2-lepton channel eμ top control region (eμ-CR)**: Requires 1 electron and 1 muon.\n- **2-lepton channel signal region (SR)**: Requires 2 leptons (electrons or muons) and 2 b-tagged jets.\n\nThese regions are defined in various analyses, and the specific requirements for each region are detailed above.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Reconstructed additional (extra) jet not from top decay", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 48, "error": null, "seconds": 0.344}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 644, "error": null, "seconds": 0.076}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:had", "hepkg:region:lep", "hepkg:region:CR-ttbar", "hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:0l-0j", "hepkg:region:0l-1j", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_mj", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1l-0j", "hepkg:region:1l-1j", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_emu", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 26, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object:H-jet", "hepkg:object:Jb-jet", "hepkg:object:Jt-jet", "hepkg:object:VR-Z-VV-njet", "hepkg:object:alfa_track", "hepkg:object:b-jet", "hepkg:object:b_jet", "hepkg:object:b_jet_particle", "hepkg:object:b_jet_reco", "hepkg:object:bjet", "hepkg:object:bjet-reco", "hepkg:object:bjet_reco", "hepkg:object:c-jet", "hepkg:object:c_jet", "hepkg:object:double-tagged-candidate-jet", "hepkg:object:electron", "hepkg:object:electron-reco", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:ele