{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-2db2a875", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Top-quark pair charge asymmetry $A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}}$?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}} \\):\n\n1. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n2. **2401.05299**: This paper includes multiple results related to the charge asymmetry, specifically:\n   - \\( A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}} \\) vs \\( N_{\\mathrm{jets}} \\)\n   - \\( A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}} \\) vs \\( H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{jet}} \\)\n   - \\( A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}} \\) vs \\( H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{lep}} \\)\n   - \\( A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}} \\) vs \\( \\Delta R_{\\ell b, \\, \\text{lead}} \\)\n   - \\( A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}} \\) vs \\( |\\Delta\\phi_{\\ell\\ell, \\, \\text{SS}}| \\)\n   - \\( A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}} \\) vs \\( |\\Delta\\eta_{\\ell\\ell, \\, \\text{SS}}| \\)\n\nThese are the distinct papers that have measured the Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}} \\) according to the graph.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2110.11231", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2401.05299", "2402.08486"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Top-quark pair charge asymmetry A_C^ttbar", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 31, "error": null, "seconds": 0.437}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 37, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:acrel-htjet", "hepkg:result:acr