{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-2dcc7e2c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Drell-Yan background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the Drell-Yan background:\n\n- 2004.14060: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2009.14537: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- 2010.14293: Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS detector\n- 2012.03799: Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2102.01444: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2106.01676: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- 2109.13808: ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling\n- 2109.13808: VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- 2206.09466: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2209.07327: Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- 2211.08028: Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\( b \\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton–proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- 2404.06204: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) Te", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2308.02285", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Drell-Yan", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.295}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.023}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:bbww_lvqq_2l2nu", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "he