{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-2ff90da4", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Diphoton system (Higgs boson candidate)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define regions that require a diphoton system (Higgs boson candidate):\n\n1. **\"Had\" region** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n2. **\"Lep\" region** - This region also requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n3. **$t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)** - This region includes a requirement for a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n4. **1-lepton channel signal region (SR)** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n5. **1L, 0 S-jet category** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n6. **1L2T channel (exactly 1 light lepton, exactly 2 h candidates)** - This channel requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n7. **1L3T channel (exactly 1 light lepton, ≥3 h candidates)** - This channel requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n8. **2-lepton channel eμ top control region (eμ-CR)** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n9. **2-lepton channel signal region (SR)** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n10. **2L, 0 S-jet category** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n11. **2L1T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, exactly 1 h candidate)** - This channel requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n12. **2L2T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, ≥2 h candidates)** - This channel requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n13. **2ℓ SS Fiducial Region** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n14. **2ℓ SS Signal Region** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n15. **2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n16. **2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n17. **2ℓ-eμ-5j2b (data-driven ttbar control region)** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n18. **2ℓ-eμ-6j1b (data-driven ttbar control region)** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n19. **2ℓ-eμ-6j2b (data-driven ttbar control region)** - This region requires a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n\nThese regions are part of various analyses that focus on different aspects of the Higgs boson decay to diphotons. Each region has specific selection criteria that include the requirement for a diphoton system (H→γγ candidate).\n\nTo provide more context, these regions are typically used in searches for the Higgs boson and in studies of its properties, such as its mass, production mechanisms, and decay modes. The diphoton system is a key signature in these analyses, as it is one of the cleanest and most distinctive decay channels of the Higgs boson.\n\nIf you need more detailed information about any specific region or analysis, please let me know.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\":", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Diphoton system (Higgs boson candidate)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 42, "error": null, "seconds": 0.334}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 483, "error": null, "seconds": 0.06}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:had", "hepkg:region:lep", "hepkg:region:CR-ttbar", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1l-0j", "hepkg:channel:1l2t", "hepkg:channel:1l3t", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_emu", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2l-0j", "hepkg:channel:2l1t", "hepkg:channel:2l2t", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-fiducial", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-sr", "hepkg:region:2l-tt-e-cr", "hepkg:region:2l-tt-mu-cr", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-5j2b", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-6j1b", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-6j2b"]}, "rows": 89, "error": null, "seconds": 0.014}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object:H-jet", "hepkg:object:bplus_candidate", "hepkg:object:dicharmonium_candidate", "hepkg:object:dijet_candidate", "hepkg:object:dilepton-system", "hepkg:object:dilepton_system", "hepkg:object:diphoton-primary-vertex", "hepkg:object:diphoton-system", "hepkg:object:diphoton_system", "hepkg:object:electron", "hepkg:object:electron-baseline", "hepkg:object:electron-candidate", "hepkg:object:electron-reco", "hepkg:object:electron_baseline", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:forward-proton-candidate", "hepkg:object:fsr-photon", "hepkg:object:fsr_photon", "hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate", "hepkg:object:higgs_boson", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:kaon_track", "hepkg:object:large-R-jet", "hepkg:object:large-r-jet", "hepkg:object:large-radius-jet", "hepkg:object:largeR-jet", "hepkg:object:large_R_jet", "hepkg:object:large_r_jet", "hepkg:object:large_radius_jet", "hepkg:object:lepton", "hepkg:object:muon", "hepkg:object:muon-baseline", "hepkg:object:muon-candidate", "hepkg:object