{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-30a414e0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Simulated background samples (DY+jets, ttbar, single top, VV)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"Simulated background samples (DY+jets, ttbar, single top, VV)\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV\n- **2004.04545**: CP Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the \\(t\\bar{t}H\\) and \\(tH\\) Processes Using \\(H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma\\) with the ATLAS Detector\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\(WH\\) and \\(ZH\\) production in the \\(H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decay channel in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(13\\, \\text{TeV}\\) with the ATLAS detector\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\)\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\(t\\bar{t}\\) production measured in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\) \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\(W\\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\)\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\(W\\) and \\(Z\\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\) and 13  TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\)\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\(b\\) final state\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\)\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Simulated background samples (DY+jets, ttbar, single top, VV)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.482}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 94, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:d