{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-317ec673", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 2-lepton channel high ΔR(b1,b2) control region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"2-lepton channel high ΔR(b1,b2) control region\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{Z}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\nThese analyses are the ones that define the specified region.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2107.12553", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2312.04450", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "2-lepton channel high ΔR(b1,b2) control region", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.529}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 59, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e"]}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:0lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:0lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_mj", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_emu", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-1jet-cr", "hepkg:region:4l-2sfos-sr", "hepkg:region:4l-zz-cr", "hepkg:region:CR_2j", "hepkg:region:CR_2j_ee", "hepkg:region:CR_b_j_b_ee", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_high", "hepkg:region:cr-1mu", "hepkg:region:cr-2lep", "hepkg:region:cr-gammaj-control", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbar-e", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbar-mu", "hepkg:region:cr-w", "hepkg:region:cr-z-e", "hepkg:region:cr_wenu", "hepkg:region:cr_wmunu", "hepkg:region:dps_control_region", "hepkg:region:ggh-df-2j-topcr", "hepkg:region:hbb_boosted_vbf", "hepkg:region:high_q2_electron_excluded", "hepkg:region:jpsi_cr", "hepkg:region:ml-cr", "hepk