{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-326468a8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 4ℓG search regions (G01–G05)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"4ℓG search regions (G01–G05)\":\n\n- **2004.01678**: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2106.01676**: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\ pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2107.12553**: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\mathup{W}$ bosons using 137 $\\,\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential $\\mathup{W}\\mathup{Z}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in $\\mathup{p}\\mathup{p}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{W}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139\\,\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\ pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{*}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n\nThese analyses define the region \"4ℓG search regions", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "4ℓG search regions (G01–G05)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.38}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 57, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:180d8e3b