{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-36b75120", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Data-driven electron charge mis-identification probability method?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate backgrounds using the Data-driven electron charge mis-identification probability method:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $t\\bar{t}+Z$ backgrounds.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets background (Z→νν).\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$ (semileptonic/dileptonic), $t\\bar{t}+Z(\\to\\nu\\nu)$, and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}Z$, $Wt$, and \"Others\" minor background categories ($VVV$, $t\\bar{t}t$, $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $t\\bar{t}WW$, $t\\bar{t}WZ$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $tZ$).\n- **2103.06956**: Estimates background with at least one misreconstructed-jet (nonprompt) photon in dijet-BDT/VBF-like category training.\n- **2106.01676**: Estimates Z+jets, WZ, and $t\\bar{t}$ backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets (primarily Z→ττ) and non-resonant WW diboson backgrounds.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates WZ irreducible background.\n- **2205.05120**: Estimates background from jets misidentified as τ_h candidates (QCD multijet, W+jets, ttbar, diboson).\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$ and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2303.15340**: Estimates $Z(→ττ)+jets$ background.\n\nThese analyses use the Data-driven electron charge mis-identification probability method to estimate various backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444"