{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-3785c167", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Jet, particle level (anti-kT R=0.4, excluding neutrinos)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring a jet at the particle level (anti-kT R=0.4, excluding neutrinos):\n\n- **2004.01678**: Signal Region (SR)\n- **2004.04545**: \"Had\" region\n- **2012.01581**: Final signal region (Region H)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)\n- **2107.12553**: 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2111.08340**: $t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)\n- **2202.08676**: 3L ttZ control region\n- **2303.15340**: $e\\mu$ fiducial phase-space region (particle level)\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2309.14442**: 5j3b fiducial phase space (>=5 jets, >=3 b jets), targeting ttb\n- **2401.05299**: \n  - 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n  - 3ℓ Signal Region\n  - 2ℓ SS Fiducial Region\n  - 3ℓ Fiducial Region\n  - 3ℓ VV Control Region\n  - 3ℓ ttZ Control Region\n  - 3ℓ IntC Control Region (internal conversion)\n  - 3ℓ MatC Control Region (material conversion)\n  - 2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions\n  - 2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions\n- **2503.19420**:\n  - 3-lepton WZ control region, 0 jets\n  - 3-lepton WZ control region, >=1 jet\n- **2508.13900**: 0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)\n\nThese analyses define regions that require jets at the particle level with the specified characteristics.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956"