{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-3bb8db07", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample $t\\bar{t}H$ background MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the $t\\bar{t}H$ background MC sample:\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2004.14060**: \"Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2102.01444**: \"Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2103.04956**: \"Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2106.01676**: \"Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2107.12553**: \"Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\mathup{W}$ bosons using 137 $\\, \\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2112.03161**: \"Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2207.00348**: \"Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2303.15340**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\mathup{t}}{}{\\mathup{\\overline{t}}}}{\\mathup{b}}{\\mathup{\\overline{b}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2009.04363", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "t tbar H", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.282}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 48, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "he