{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-3ca15b6c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Average ΔR over all b-jet pairs (ΔR_bb^avg)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the observable \"Average ΔR over all b-jet pairs (ΔR_bb^avg)\":\n\n1. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n2. **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n3. **2401.05299**: Absolute differential cross-section vs \\( N_{\\mathrm{jets}} \\) result.\n4. **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n5. **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese are the distinct papers that have results measuring the observable \"Average ΔR over all b-jet pairs (ΔR_bb^avg)\".\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2007.02873", "2103.04956", "2111.08340", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2511.11853", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Average ΔR over all b-jet pairs (ΔR_bb^avg)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 52, "error": null, "seconds": 0.423}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 75, "error": null, "seconds": 0.051}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {