{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-422fb969", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Shape-fit signal region SR^h_1AB overlapping SR^h_1A and SR^h_1B?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object 'Shape-fit signal region SR^h_1AB overlapping SR^h_1A and SR^h_1B':\n- 2004.01678: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a Z Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV pp Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of WH and ZH production in the H→bb decay channel in pp collisions at 13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- 2009.14537: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- 2107.12553: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and W bosons using 137 fb^-1 of proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2110.11231: Measurement of the inclusive and differential WZ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using H→bb decays in the ATLAS detector\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- 2206.09466: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the W boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in pp→tt̄ production at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2304.08962: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of t̄tW production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2404.06204: Precise measurements of W - and Z -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using pp collisions at √s=5.02 TeV and 13 TeV\n- 2510.07527: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2511.11853: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Shape-fit signal region SR^h_1AB overlapping SR^h_1A and SR^h_1B", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.557}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12", "hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "hepkg:result:d