{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-46ea8e5a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Drell-Yan comparison sample, not used as background estimate (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"Drell-Yan comparison sample, not used as background estimate (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD)\":\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{t}}}}}}}{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{b}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2405.18661**: \"CMS Z+jets differential cross section measurement (jet multiplicity) at 13 TeV\"\n- **2508.13900**: \"General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state\"\n- **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2009.04363", "2012.08600", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Drell-Yan comparison sample, not used as background estimate (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, LO QCD)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.581}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 66, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:zjets_differential_13tev", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:diboson-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:drell-yan", "hepkg:sample:drell_yan_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:drellyan-madgraph-comparison", "hepkg:sample:drellyan_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:dy-background-mc", "hepkg:sample:dy-mc", "hepkg:sample:dy_photon_jets_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:gammajets_strong_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample