sociation with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and \\( 13 \\) TeV.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS \\( tt\\bar{Z} \\) (ttZ) associated production cross section measurement.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS four top quark (tttt) production measurement.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result.\n- **2511.11853**: Search for a new neutral gauge boson", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2308.02285", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Single top quark", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.255}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 39, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:fourtop_measurement", "hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d482