{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-475b63b7", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region Control region CR^h_ttbar for ttbar background normalisation (1ℓ selection)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"Control region CR^h_ttbar for ttbar background normalisation (1ℓ selection)\" or similar:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2004.01678**: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a \\( Z \\) Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV \\( pp \\) Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector.\n- **2008.05928**: Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\( pp \\) Collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS Detector.\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2207.12246**: Measurement of the total cross section and \\( \\rho \\)-parameter from elastic scattering in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\)- and \\( Z \\)-boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) and \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese analyses define various control regions related to \\( t\\bar{t} \\) background normalisation, including the specific region mentioned in the question.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2312.04450", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Control region CR^h_ttbar for ttbar background normalisation (1ℓ selection)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.498}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:17