{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-47e631eb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Background modelled from data sidebands of mass distributions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using the method \"Background modelled from data sidebands of mass distributions\":\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets background and $t\\bar{t}$ background.\n- **2007.02873**: Estimates Z+jets background.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets background (Z→νν).\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates ttbar (semileptonic/dileptonic) background and Z+jets background.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$ background and $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ background.\n- **2106.01676**: Uses Z+jets MC sample and estimates ttbar and Z+jets (FNP-lepton) background.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets background (primarily Z->tautau).\n- **2110.11231**: Estimates VVV triboson background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background and $t\\bar{t}H$ background.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates t t̄ background and Z+jets background.\n- **2303.15340**: Estimates $Z(\\to\\tau\\tau)+\\text{jets}$ background.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates top quark-antiquark (ttbar) background, diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background, and Z+jets (or virtual photon) background.\n- **2312.04450**: Estimates $Z$+jets background ($Z+b$, $Z+c$, $Z+l$), $WZ$+jets background ($WZ+b$, $WZ+c$, $WZ+l$), $ZZ$+jets background ($ZZ+b$, $ZZ+c$, $ZZ+l$), and $tZq$ background.\n\nThese analyses use various methods to estimate backgrounds, including the method \"Background modelled from data sidebands of mass distributions.\"\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate a background using the method 