{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-49916692", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background continuum non-resonant diphoton background in the $m_{\\gamma\\gamma}$ spectrum?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background continuum non-resonant diphoton background in the \\( m_{\\gamma\\gamma} \\) spectrum:\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the \\( t\\bar{t}H \\) and \\( tH \\) Processes Using \\( H \\rightarrow \\gamma\\gamma \\) with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n3. **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n4. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n5. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n6. **2510.07527**: \"HH->bb gamgam analysis result\"\n7. **2510.07527**: \"HH->gamgamtautau analysis result\"\n8. **2510.07527**: \"HH->bbZZ(4l) analysis result\"\n9. **2510.07527**: \"HH->WWgamgam analysis result\"\n10. **2602.18611**: \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n11. **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( \\mathup{{{b}}} \\) final state\"\n12. **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson properties, top quark interactions, and various final states involving diphotons and other particles. Each of these papers provides detailed estimates of the continuum non-resonant diphoton background in the \\( m_{\\gamma\\gamma} \\) spectrum.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "continuum non-resonant diphoton background", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.404}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 136, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:wwgamgam", "hepkg:result:bbgamgam", "hepkg:result:bbzz", "hepkg:result:gamgamtautau", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbgamgam_continuum", "hepkg:background:bbzz_z