{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-5099fcde", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Multijet background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the Multijet background:\n\n1. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: 2111.08340)\n2. **Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Paper ID: 2202.08676)\n3. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (Paper ID: 2205.05120)\n4. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: 2208.12095)\n5. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations** (Paper ID: 2312.04450)\n6. **CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement** (Paper ID: 2405.18661)\n7. **HH->bb tautau analysis result** (Paper ID: 2510.07527)\n8. **HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result** (Paper ID: 2510.07527)\n9. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Paper ID: 2602.18611)\n10. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( \\mathup{{{b}}} \\) final state** (Paper ID: 2604.27044)\n\nThese papers cover a range of analyses that estimate the Multijet background.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Multijet background", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.311}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 144, "error": null, "seconds": 0.05}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbbb_resolved_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbtautau_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbww4q_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:combinatorial", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:diboson_vv", "hepkg:background:dps", "hepkg:background:dy_background", "hepkg:background:dy_jets", "hepkg:background:dyjets", "hepkg:background:fnp", "hepkg:background:gamma-jets", "hepkg:background:jet-to-tauh-misid", "hepkg:background:jets-nonprompt", "hepkg:background:mis-id-leptons", "hepkg:background:misid-lepton", "hepkg:background:misid_lepton", "hepkg:background:mt_background", "hepkg:back