{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-512a2061", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 3L, >=1 S-jet category (inclusive)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"3L, >=1 S-jet category (inclusive)\":\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H \\to \\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson decays, multilepton probes, and searches for new phenomena.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.04363", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.14246", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "3L, >=1 S-jet category (inclusive)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.425}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 46, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702"]}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:0l-0j", "hepkg:region:0l-1j", "hepkg:region:0l-2j", "hepkg:region:0l-3j", "hepkg:region:0l-4j", "hepkg:region:0l-5j", "hepkg:region:1l-0j", "hepkg:region:1l-1j", "hepkg:region:1l-2j", "hepkg:region:1l-3j", "hepkg:region:1l-4j", "hepkg:region:2l-0j", "hepkg:region:2l-1j", "hepkg:region:2l-2j", "hepkg:region:3l-0j", "hepkg:region:3l-1j", "hepkg:region:3l-fiducial", "hepkg:region:3l-intc-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-matc-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-onz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-sr", "hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-vv-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-1jet-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-zgamma-cr", "hepkg:region:boosted-category", "hepkg:region:fiducial-3l-parton", "hepkg:region:ggH-1j-pt-120-200", "hepkg:region:ggH-1j-pt-60-120", "hepkg:region:ggH-1j-pt-lt60", "hepkg:region:ggH-2j-mjjlt350-pt120-200", "hepkg:region:ggH-2j-mjjlt350-ptlt120", "hepkg:region:ggh-0jet-category", "hepkg:region:jet_inclusive_fiducial", "hepkg:region:multilepton_1l3tauh", "hepkg:region:multilepton_2l2tauh", "hepkg:region:multilepton_3l", "hepkg:region:multilepton_3l1tauh", "hepkg:region:sr-1b"