{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-519b3717", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Signal region SR^Z_1B (3ℓ selection, small χ̃2⁰-χ̃1⁰ mass splitting)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Signal region SR^Z_1B (3ℓ selection, small χ̃2⁰-χ̃1⁰ mass splitting)\" or similar signal regions:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{Z}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( \\mathup{{W}}\\mathup{{Z}} \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( \\mathup{{p}}\\mathup{{p}} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( \\mathup{{W}} \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson production, top quark production, and searches for new physics. Each", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Signal region SR^Z_1B (3ℓ selection, small χ̃2⁰-χ̃1⁰ mass splitting)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.505}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 55, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result