{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-534ff784", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 3ℓ MatC Control Region (material conversion)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"3ℓ MatC Control Region (material conversion)\":\n\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n\nThese analyses are the ones that define the specific region \"3ℓ MatC Control Region (material conversion)\" in their respective studies.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "3ℓ MatC Control Region", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.446}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 54, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5"]}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.018}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:2l1t-misid-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-fiducial", "hepkg:region:3l-intc-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-matc-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-misid-emu-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-onz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-sr", "hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-vv-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-zgamma-cr", "hepkg:region:4l-zz-cr", "hepkg:region:CR-ttbar", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_c", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_light", "hepkg:region:bbzz_4l_cr", "hepkg:region:cr-1mu", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-5j2b", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-6j1b", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-6j2b", "hepkg:region:cr-conv", "hepkg:region:cr-gamma", "hepkg:region:cr-gammaj-control", "hepkg:region:cr-mgg-sideband", "hepkg:region:cr-q", "hepkg:region:cr-sideband", "hepkg:region:cr-ttz", "hepkg:region:cr-w", "hepkg:region:cr-zz", "hepkg:region:cr_gamma", "hepkg:region:cr_wenu", "hepkg:region:cr_wmunu", "hepkg:region:cr_zee", "hepkg:region:cr_zmumu", "hepkg:region:cr_zmumu_ltau_lprime", "hepkg:region:crttz", "hepkg:region:multilepton_wz_cr", "hepkg:region:m