{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-535f7ab1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample W+jets background MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses used the W+jets background MC sample:\\n\\n- 2001.06899: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2004.14060: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic t̄t plus missing transverse momentum final state at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of WH and ZH production in the H→b̄b decay channel in pp collisions at 13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2008.05928: Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in pp Collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS Detector\\n- 2103.04956: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2106.01676: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in √s=13 TeV pp collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2107.12553: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and W bosons using 137 fb⁻¹ of proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using H→b̄b decays in the ATLAS detector\\n- 2112.00895: Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at √s=8 TeV\\n- 2112.03161: Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2201.11585: Search for invisible decays of the Higgs boson produced via vector boson fusion in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in pp→t̄t production at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a W boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of t̄tb̄b production in the lepton+jets channel at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of t̄tW production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2403.01556: Search", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "W+jets", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 26, "error": null, "seconds": 0.253}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 33, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg