{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-55a3e9c2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 3ℓE search regions (E01–E09)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"3ℓE search regions (E01–E09)\":\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb$^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{*}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n\nThese analyses are the ones that define the region \"3ℓE search regions (E01–E09)\" according to the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "3ℓE search regions (E01–E09)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.409}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 66, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:reg