{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-5682b17e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring b-tagged jet (relaxed working point, other b jets)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define regions that require b-tagged jets (relaxed working point, other b jets):\n\n1. **\"Had\" region**:\n   - MET trigger threshold 70-110 GeV (varying 2015-2018).\n   - 150 GeV < p_T^V < 250 GeV or p_T^V > 250 GeV.\n   - 2-jet or 3-jet category, at most one untagged jet in 3-jet category.\n   - H_T requirement to remove trigger-efficiency dependence on jet multiplicity.\n   - Angular separation requirements between E_T^miss, jets, and p_T^miss to reject multi-jet background.\n\n2. **$t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR_{t\\bar{t}})$**:\n   - Nominal event selection with inverted (anti-)lepton isolation requirement.\n   - MJ normalisation from template fit to m_T^W distribution with 2-b-tag requirement.\n\n3. **0-lepton channel signal region (SR)**:\n   - Single-electron trigger p_T threshold 24 GeV (2015) to 26 GeV (2016-2018).\n   - E_T^miss > 30 GeV in electron sub-channel.\n\n4. **0L, 0 S-jet category**:\n   - 2-jet or 3-jet category, at most one untagged jet in 3-jet category.\n   - 150 GeV < p_T^V < 250 GeV or p_T^V > 250 GeV.\n\n5. **0L, 1 S-jet category**:\n   - Exactly two particle-level leptons with the same charge, each p_T >= 20 GeV.\n   - m_ll > 12 GeV for same-flavour pairs.\n\n6. **0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)**:\n   - Two tight (TT) same-sign light leptons, each with p_T > 20 GeV.\n   - Leading/sub-leading leptons pass TMex, MexT, or MexMex criteria, sub-leading lepton is an electron; leptons pT (20,20) GeV.\n   - m_T(l0, MET) < 250 GeV for the TMex and MexT sub-regions.\n\n7. **1 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ)**:\n   - Dilepton invariant mass close to the Z boson mass.\n   - Opposite-sign charge required for dimuon events only.\n   - Single-muon trigger p_T threshold ranging from 20 GeV to 26 GeV (2016-2018).\n\n8. **1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)**:\n   - Any number of untagged jets accepted in ≥3-jet category.\n   - 75 GeV < p_T^V < 150 GeV medium region, 150 GeV < p_T^V < 250 GeV, or p_T^V > 250 GeV.\n\n9. **1-lepton channel signal region (SR)**:\n   - Binned in M_T2(ll), p_T(ll), p_T^miss and lepton-sign combination (Table 4).\n   - OSSF light-lepton pair with M_ll < 12 GeV vetoed.\n\n10. **12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)**:\n    - J_b and J_t jets required to have p_T >", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "b-tagged jet (relaxed working point, other b jets)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 37, "error": null, "seconds": 0.345}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 450, "error": null, "seconds": 0.056}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:had", "hepkg:region:CR-ttbar