{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-57552329", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty ttbar background modelling uncertainty (parton shower/hadronisation, generator choice, ISR/FSR, scale variations)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty related to ttbar background modelling (parton shower/hadronisation, generator choice, ISR/FSR, scale variations):\n\n1. **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n2. **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n3. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n4. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n5. **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H \\to \\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment.\n6. **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n7. **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n8. **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n9. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n10. **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n11. **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n12. **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV.\n13. **2510.07527**: HH->bbWW, WW->lvqq/2l2nu analysis result.\n14. **2510.07527**: HH->multilepton analysis result.\n15. **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n16. **2604.21670**: Effective", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ttbar background modelling uncertainty (parton shower/hadronisation, generator choice, ISR/FSR, scale variations)", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.596}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 78, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_i