{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-58682b5f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region Signal region SR^Z_2A (3ℓ selection, t̃2→Zt̃1, small mass splitting)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"Signal region SR^Z_2A (3ℓ selection, t̃2→Zt̃1, small mass splitting)\" or similar:\n\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\to b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\to t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese papers cover a range of topics including Higgs boson production, \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production, and various associated production processes. Each of these analyses defines specific signal regions that match the description provided.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Signal region SR^Z_2A (3ℓ selection, t̃2→Zt̃1, small mass splitting)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.505}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 45, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e"]}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-fiducial", "hepkg:region:3l-sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdep-sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdom-sr", "hepkg:region:4l-2sfos-sr", "hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zcc", "hepkg:region:cr-2body-ttbar", "hepkg:region:cr-2lep", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbarZ", "hepkg:region:dl_osz_control", 