{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-59d84eda", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Background normalization/shape constrained using dedicated control regions (CRs)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using methods involving dedicated control regions (CRs):\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $W$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets and W+jets backgrounds.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$ and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2106.01676**: Estimates Z+jets, SM WZ, and $t\\bar{t}$ backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets and non-resonant WW diboson backgrounds.\n- **2110.11231**: Estimates VVV triboson background.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $W{+}\\text{jets}$ and $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates $t t̄$, W+jets, and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates top quark-antiquark (ttbar) and diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [