{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-5e516fe9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 4-lepton 2-SFOS signal region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"4-lepton 2-SFOS signal region\":\n\n1. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Paper ID: 2510.07527)\n2. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: 2208.12095)\n3. **Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Paper ID: 2202.08676)\n4. **Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Paper ID: 2110.11231)\n5. **Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: 2401.05299)\n6. **Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: 2007.02873)\n7. **Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Paper ID: 2206.09466)\n8. **Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV** (Paper ID: 2503.19420)\n\nThese analyses are the ones that specifically define the 