{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-5f0e12f3", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $WW$ background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 25 analyses that estimate the $WW$ background. Here are some of the specific analyses:\n\n1. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:5b02fcf61026635f617229ab`\n\n2. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:236098828cb5c27d09cee9dd`, `hepkg:assertion:016dd5fe62bffe9a6a522db0`, `hepkg:assertion:61a8acebb4afbf37c0d6d35d`\n\n3. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:6d3156a7629f5767d0922d8f`\n\n4. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations**:\n   - Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:feaf1b4d540864d4a4911808`, `hepkg:assertion:8d4a0dd66fb82f996c233b7a`\n\n5. **Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:af5b19726cdc5afce48b7fd5`\n\n6. **Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13 TeV**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:86455a876b243951f515f9a2`\n\n7. **Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**:\n   - Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:f47cb44705e1e5c8ce69e61b`, `hepkg:assertion:9a181909371601a83daea832`, `hepkg:assertion:38ba6b45fc27d04427d72591`\n\n8. **Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:55ac437b02a186f32012a0e8`, `hepkg:assertion:7e1da03d1197638", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "WW", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "seconds": 0.256}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 55, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:diboson_vv", "hepkg:background:flavor_symmetric", "hepkg:background:fnp-lepton-rjr", "hepkg:background:minor-rare-backgrounds", "hepkg:background:mw_background", "hepkg:background:other-sm-minor", "hepkg:background:others-minor", "hepkg:background:rare-processes", "hepkg:background:single-top", "hepkg:background:single_top", "hepkg:background:singletop", "hepkg:background:sm_higgs_decays", "hepkg:background:twz", "hepkg:background:w-boson", "hepkg:background:w-jets", "hepkg:background:w-lnu-bg-tau-chargemisid", "hepkg:background:w_jets", "hepkg:background:w_plus_jets", "hepkg:background:wbb", 