{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-5fc4add1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Triboson (VVV) background sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"Triboson (VVV) background sample\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{Z}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( \\mathup{{W}}\\mathup{{Z}} \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( \\mathup{{p}}\\mathup{{p}} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( \\mathup{{W}} \\) and \\( \\mathup{{Z}} \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( \\mathup{{b}} \\) final state.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the Triboson (VVV) background sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Triboson (VVV) background sample", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.361}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 110, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.013}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:background-diboson-qq", "hepkg:sample:background-ttbar", "hepkg:sample:background-zje