{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-65bad25b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Control-region-based normalization fit for $t\\bar{t}$+jets components?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using Control-region-based normalization fit for \\( t\\bar{t} \\) + jets components:\n\n1. **2004.14060**: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n2. **2012.03799**: Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n3. **2102.01444**: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n4. **2106.01676**: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n5. **2211.08028**: Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\( b \\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton–proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n6. **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n7. **2506.13565**: Search for nonresonant new physics signals in high-mass dilepton events produced in association with \\( b \\)-tagged jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n8. **2511.11853**: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two \\( b \\)-jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n9. **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n10. **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state.\n\nThese analyses use various methods to estimate the \\( t\\bar{t} \\) + jets background, including control-region-based normalization fits.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Control-region-based normalization fit for t tbar+jets", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.444}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_method", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 120, "error": null, "seconds": 0.051}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:ttbar"], "predicate": "background_uses_method"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}, {"round": 4, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_ids": ["hepkg:background:ttbar"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.007}, {"round": 5, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24