{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-6acc379f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the generator GEANT4?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the generator GEANT4:\n\n- **2004.01678**: This paper uses the following samples generated with GEANT4:\n  - Signal MC sample (ggF H→Z(Q/a))\n  - Z+jets background MC sample\n  - Diboson (ZZ, ZW) background MC sample (qq-initiated)\n  - Gluon-induced ZZ background MC sample\n  - $t\\bar{t}$ background MC sample\n\n- **2008.05928**: This paper uses the following samples generated with GEANT4:\n  - Z' -> Hγ signal MC sample (eight mass points, 700-4000 GeV)\n  - γ+jets background MC sample\n  - W/Z+γ background MC sample\n  - t̄t+γ background MC sample\n\n- **2009.14537**: This paper uses the following sample generated with GEANT4:\n  - Single-dissociative photon-fusion signal MC sample, pp->p(γγ→ℓ+ℓ-)p*\n\n- **2011.07812**: This paper uses the following sample generated with GEANT4:\n  - GMSB SUSY signal MC sample (simplified model, up to 2 extra partons)\n\n- **2207.12246**: This paper uses the following sample generated with GEANT4:\n  - Full Geant4 simulation (detector resolution scale-setting)\n\n- **2401.07090**: This paper uses the following sample generated with GEANT4:\n  - Simulated B+ -> K+ l+l- signal sample (nonresonant)\n\n- **2404.06204**: This paper uses the following sample generated with GEANT4:\n  - Powheg+Pythia8 (AZNLO tune, CT10 PDF) nominal W/Z signal MC sample\n\n- **2510.07527**: This paper uses the following samples generated with GEANT4:\n  - ggF HH signal MC sample (POWHEG v2 NLO matrix elements, 4 kappa_lambda points)\n  - VBF HH signal MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6.5 LO, 7 coupling points)\n  - VHH signal MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6.5 LO, 8 coupling points)\n\n- **2511.11853**: This paper uses the following sample generated with GEANT4:\n  - Z' signal MC samples (m_Z' = 125-350 GeV, delta_bs = 0.04/0.5/1.0)\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the generator GEANT4 in their analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2207.12246", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2510.07527", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "GEANT4", "kind": "generator"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.242}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "sample_uses_generator", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:background-ttbar", "hepkg:sample:background-diboson-qq", "hepkg:sample:geant4_full_simulation", "hepkg:sample:gmsb-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:background-diboson-gg-zz", "hepkg:sample:powheg-pythia8-signal", "hepkg:sample:signal-ggf-h-z-q-a", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_k_ll", "hepkg:sample:mc-single-dissociative-signal", "hepkg:sample:vbf_hh_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:vhh_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:wz-gamma-bkg-mc", "hepkg:sample:zprime-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:background-zjets", "hepkg:sample:ggf_hh_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-gamma-bkg-mc", "hepkg:sample:gamma-jets-bkg-mc"]}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:generator:geant4", "hepkg:generator:geant4-simulation", "hepkg:generator:lpair4.0", "hepkg:generator:photospp"]}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:generator:geant4", "hepkg:generator:geant4-simulation", "hepkg:generator:lpair4.0", "hepkg:generator:photospp", "hepkg:sample:background-diboson-gg-zz", "hepkg:sample:background-diboson-qq", "hepkg:sample:background-ttbar", "hepkg:sample:background-zjets", "hepkg:sample:gamma-jets-bkg-mc", "hepkg:sample:geant4_full_simulation", "hepkg:sample:ggf_hh_powheg", "hepkg:sample:gmsb-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:mc-single-dissociative-signal", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_k_ll", "hepkg:sample:powhe