{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-70a80ff9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Background probability density function estimated using both data and simulation?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using a method that involves both data and simulation:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets background, $t\\bar{t}$ background, and $t\\bar{t}+Z$ background.\n- **2007.02873**: Estimates Z+jets background.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets background (Z→νν).\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates ttbar (semileptonic/dileptonic) background, ttbar+Z(->nu nu) background, and Z+jets background.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$ background, $t\\bar{t}Z$ background, $Wt$ single-top background, $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ background, and \"Others\" minor background category ($VVV$, $t\\bar{t}t$, $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $t\\bar{t}WW$, $t\\bar{t}WZ$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $tZ$).\n- **2106.01676**: Estimates SM WZ background (three real prompt leptons), ttbar background, and Z+jets (FNP-lepton) background.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets background (primarily Z->tautau).\n- **2110.11231**: Estimates VVV triboson background.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background and $t\\bar{t}H$ background.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates t t̄ background and Z+jets background.\n- **2307.01094**: Estimates charge-flip electron background.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates top quark-antiquark (ttbar) background.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06