{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-718efa3e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object 3D prompt track?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"3D prompt track\":\n\n- **2004.01678**: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n- **2004.14060**: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2006.05880**: Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb$^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\n- **2008.05928**: Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in $pp$ Collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS Detector\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- **2011.07812**: Search for displaced leptons in $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2012.01581**: Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2012.08600**: Search for supersymmetry in final states with two oppositely charged same-flavor leptons and missing transverse momentum in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2107.12553**: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\mathup{W}$ bosons using 137 $\\, \\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2207.12246**: Measurement of the total cross section and $\\rho$-parameter from elastic scattering in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2307.01094**: Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.08600", "2107.12553", "2111.08340", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2307.01094", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "3D prompt track", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "seconds": 0.252}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:de78c3f754afbc4965051e45", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12", "hepkg:result:1b05d75dca9cf140bac022d5", "hepkg:result:dd53bd1f0b8e16150e060072", "hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54e