{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-7586e616", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample $t\\bar{t}$ MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the $t\\bar{t}$ MC sample:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\, \\text{Te}\\kern-1.00006ptV$ with the ATLAS detector\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te}\\hskip-0.80002ptV$\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te}\\hskip-0.80002ptV$\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te}\\hskip-0.80002ptV$\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te}\\hskip-0.80002ptV$\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the $t\\bar{t}$ MC sample according to the graph.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses used the $t\\\\bar{t}$ MC sample:\\n\\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a $\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\, \\\\text{Te}\\\\kern-1.00006ptV$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2402.08486", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "t tbar MC sample", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.378}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 113, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "