{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-75a82138", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Non-WW diboson background (WZ/gamma*, ZZ/gamma*, Wgamma, Zgamma)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background Non-WW diboson background (WZ/gamma*, ZZ/gamma*, Wgamma, Zgamma):\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n3. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n4. **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n5. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n6. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n7. **2405.18661**: \"CMS ttbar+W (ttW) associated production cross section measurement\"\n8. **2408.03744**: \"Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\"\n9. **2510.07527**: \"HH->multilepton analysis result\"\n10. **2510.07527**: \"HH->bbZZ(4l) analysis result\"\n11. **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state\"\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson properties, diboson production, and top quark interactions. Each of these papers estimates the Non-WW diboson background as part of their analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Non-WW diboson background (WZ/gamma*, ZZ/gamma*, Wgamma, Zgamma)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.508}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 110, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:ttw_measurement", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbzz", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbzz_zplusx", "hepkg:background:continuum_diphoton", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson-2lOS", "hepkg:background:diboson-rjr", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:diboson_background