{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-786822f6", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background QCD multijet background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the QCD multijet background:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2010.14293**: Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2012.01581**: Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2109.13808**: VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (\\( a_L \\), \\( a_T \\) / \\( \\kappa_{VV} \\), \\( \\epsilon_{VV} \\)).\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2209.07327**: Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2211.08028**: Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\( b \