{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-7bf50cef", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 2-lepton channel signal region (SR)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"2-lepton channel signal region (SR)\":\n\n1. **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\"\n2. **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n3. **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n4. **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n5. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n6. **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n7. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n8. **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n9. **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\"\n\nThese papers are the ones that define the \"2-lepton channel signal region (SR)\" in their respective analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2511.11853", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "2-lepton channel signal region (SR)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.386}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 57, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e"]}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:0lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:0lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_mj", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-sr", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_emu", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_highdR", "hepkg:region:2lep_cr_lowdR", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdep-sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdom-sr", "hepkg:region:4l-1sfos-sr", "hepkg:region:4l-2sfos-sr", "hepkg:region:4l-zz-cr", "hepkg:region:SRL", "hepkg:region:SRS", "hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b", "hepkg:region:cr-2lep", "hepkg:region:diphoton-baseline-sr", "hepkg:region:dl_search_region", "hepkg:region:ggf2je