{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-7d436274", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)\":\n\n1. **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n2. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n3. **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\({{\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}\\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}\\)\n4. **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}\\)\n5. **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}\\)\n\nThese are the distinct papers that define the specified region.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.04363", "2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2405.18661", "2508.13900", "2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.358}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 47, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f3