{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-7d8d0c95", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Dilepton (ℓℓ) system?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring a Dilepton (ℓℓ) system:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Preselection region (m_llj < 250 GeV)\n- **2004.04545**: \"Lep\" region\n- **2006.05880**: Control regions CR^Z_ttZ, CR^Z_VV, and CR^h_ttbar for background normalisation\n- **2008.05928**: Double-b-tagged signal region (photon + large-R jet)\n- **2009.14537**: Preselection region (opposite-charge same-flavor dilepton, Z-veto, low p_T^ll) and combinatorial background control/mixed-data sample\n- **2012.01581**: Common dijet/SV preselection region\n- **2012.08600**: Boosted VZ (EW on-Z), Edge b veto counting region, and Edge b tag counting region\n- **2102.01444**: Two-body \\( t\\bar{t} \\) control region, \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) control region, and fake/non-prompt lepton control region\n- **2103.04956**: Baseline H->4l ZZ-candidate selection (reconstruction level)\n- **2107.12553**: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6)\n- **2309.14442**: Fiducial phase spaces targeting \\( t\\bar{t} \\), \\( t\\bar{t}b \\), \\( t\\bar{t}bj \\), and \\( t\\bar{t}bbj \\)\n- **2508.13900**: Common preselection region (all channels), 1L, 0 S-jet category, 2L, 0 S-jet category, and 3L, 0 S-jet category\n\nThese analyses cover a wide range of regions and final states involving dilepton systems.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2012.01581", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2402.08486", "2405.1