{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-7e2f93f2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Large-R jet (anti-kT R=0.8)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Large-R jet (anti-kT R=0.8)\":\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2109.13808**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson properties using $WW^{*}(\\\\rightarrow e\\\\nu\\\\mu\\\\nu)jj$ production in $36.1\\text{ fb}^{-1}$ of $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\"\n- **2504.13081**: \"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\"\n- **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\"\n\nThese papers are the ones that define the object \"Large-R jet (anti-kT R=0.8)\" in their respective analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Large-R jet (anti-kT R=0.8)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 36, "error": null, "seconds": 0.429}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 134, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:final_state:3l", "hepkg:final_state:4l", "hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:52d0213216b446bc782fa4dc", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe"]}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.013}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object:Jb-jet", "hepkg:object:Jt-jet", "hepkg:object:ak4-jet", "hepkg:object:ak4_jet", "hepkg:object:ak8-jet", "hepkg:object:ak8_jet", "hepkg:object:anti-id-lepton", "hepkg:object:anti-tagged-candidate-jet", "hepkg:object:b-jet", "hepkg:object:b-tagged-jet", "hepkg:object:b_jet", "hepkg: