{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-7e81affd", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the generator PHOTOS?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the generator PHOTOS:\n\n- **2304.08962**: Used SPS (single parton scattering) di-charmonium MC sample, DPS (double parton scattering) di-charmonium MC sample, and Non-prompt di-charmonium MC sample (from b-hadron decays).\n- **2401.07090**: Used Simulated B+ -> K+ l+l- signal sample (nonresonant).\n- **2404.06204**: Used Powheg+Pythia8 (AZNLO tune, CT10 PDF) nominal W/Z signal MC sample.\n- **2405.18661**: Used MadGraph5_aMC@NLO + pythia PS + photos FSR, normalized to FEWZ2.0 NNLO, W charge asymmetry.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used PHOTOS in their analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2304.08962", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "PHOTOS", "kind": "generator"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.219}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "sample_uses_generator", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:dps_mc", "hepkg:sample:w_asym_mg5_mcatnlo_py_photos", "hepkg:sample:nonprompt_mc", "hepkg:sample:powheg-pythia8-signal", "hepkg:sample:sps_mc", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_k_ll"]}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:generator:photos", "hepkg:generator:photos361", "hepkg:generator:photospp"]}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:generator:photos", "hepkg:generator:photos361", "hepkg:generator:photospp", "hepkg:sample:dps_mc", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_k_ll", "hepkg:sample:nonprompt_mc", "hepkg:sample:powheg-pythia8-signal", "hepkg:sample:sps_mc", "hepkg:sample:w_asym_mg5_mcatnlo_py_photos"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:27d7b6378d804073cff81494", "hepkg:evidence:40422fa7d8b198e544878acb", "hepkg:evidence:4ab600b788c6d85702d40421", "hepkg:evidence:fa59d225e1e2ebe041571eb0"], "seen_values": ["0", "2304.08962", "2401.0709", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "3.61", "asymmetry", "aznlo", "b-hadron", "charge", "ct10", "decays", "di-charmonium", "double", "dps", "fewz2", "final-state", "from", "fsr", "generator", "hepkg:assertion:3a0422e5cadfae566e2baf61", "hepkg:assertion:45af548c955a87ccf9907bf1", "hepkg:assertion:6d22a97cea3eccc24dd2fa58", "hepkg:assertion:86bba068a7ae54d7d948e1a0", "hepkg:assertion:902c81e3600940058bae27ee", "hepkg:assertion:fd8265a7cf3e046e0be1558f", "hepkg:generator:photos", "hepkg:generator:photos361", "hepkg:generator:photospp", "hepkg:sample:dps_mc", "hepkg:sample:mc_bp_k_ll", "hepkg:sample:nonprompt_mc", "hepkg:sample:powheg-pythia8-signal", "hepkg:sample:sps_mc", "hepkg:sample:w_asym_mg5_mcatnlo_py_photos", "madgraph5_amc", "nlo", "nnlo", "nominal", "non-prompt", "nonresonant", "normalized", "parton", "pdf", "photos", "powheg", "pythia", "pythia8", "qed", "radiation", "sample", "sample_uses_generator", "scattering", "signal", "simulated", "single", "sps", "tune"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 4, "prompt_tokens": 15676, "completion_tokens": 355, "rounds": 4, "seconds": 11.750639817677438, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 11.750639817677438, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 16031.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "entity_retrieved": 1.0, "entities_seen": 9.0, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 9.0, "evidence_quotes": 4.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-7e9db462", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background ttbar background (bbtautau)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the \\( t\\bar{t} \\) background (including \\( bb\\tau\\tau \\)):\n\n1. **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n2. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n3. **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n4. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n5. **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n6. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n7. **2405.18661**: CMS \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) associated production cross section measurement.\n8. **2405.18661**: CMS four top quark (\\( t\\bar{t}\\bar{t}\\bar{t} \\)) production measurement.\n9. **2510.07527**: HH->bb tautau analysis result.\n10. **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n11. **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state.\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topic