{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-7eea162f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Branching fraction B(H→μμ)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the branching fraction \\( B(H \\to \\mu\\mu) \\):\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H \\to \\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n3. **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H \\to b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n4. **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of $t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n5. **2401.07090**: \"Differential branching fraction measurement of $B^+ \\to K^+ \\mu^+ \\mu^-$ across 15 $q^2$ bins\"\n6. **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n7. **2408.03744**: \"Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\"\n8. **2503.19420**: \"95% CL upper limit on POI for llH, $p_T^V \\ge 150\\,\\text{GeV}$ category (STXS scheme)\"\n9. **2602.18611**: \"Effective coupling modifier fit with $B_\\text{inv}$, $B_\\text{undet}$ floating and $|\\kappa_V| \\le 1$ constraint\"\n10. **2602.18611**: \"Effective coupling modifier fit with off-shell $H \\to ZZ \\to 4l$ analysis included\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of measurements related to the branching fraction \\( B(H \\to \\mu\\mu) \\).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2309.14442", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2511.11853", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Branching fraction B(H→μμ)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.33}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 76, "error": null, "seconds": 0.051}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:upperlimit-llh-ptv-ge150", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:diff_bf_bp_k_mumu", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_binv_kv1", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_offshell", "hepkg:result:electron_single_ratio_pflp", "hepkg:result:electron_single_ratio_pfpf", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:int_bf_low_q2", "hepkg:result:int_bf_full_q2", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404"]}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.013}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:HT_bjets", "hepkg:observable:b-jet-fraction", "hepkg:observable:br_diff_mutau_etau", "hepkg:observable:br_h_etau", "hepkg:observable:br_h_mutau", "hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "hepkg:observable:branching-fraction-h-mumu", "hepkg:observable:bsm_branching_fraction_invisible", "hepkg:observable:bsm_branching_fraction_undetected", "hepkg:observable:diff-sigma-stxs", "hepkg:observable:diff_bf_dq2", "hepkg:observable:eft_coefficient_constraints", "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_w", "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_wminus", "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_wplus", "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_z", "hepkg:observable:higgs_br_ul", "hepkg:observable:higgs_branching_fraction_ratio", "hepkg