{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-7f2e7218", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Cross section ratio R(c/b) = σ(Z+c jets)/σ(Z+b jets)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The analysis in paper 2001.06899 measured the cross section ratio \\( R(c/b) = \\sigma(Z+c\\ \\text{jets})/\\sigma(Z+b\\ \\text{jets}) \\). Here are some key details from the paper:\n\n- **Background Estimation Methods**:\n  - Background from \\( t\\bar{t} \\) was estimated from simulation (POWHEG+Pythia8), normalized to NNLO cross section with soft-gluon resummation from top++ v2.0, with a systematic uncertainty from a 5.5% cross-section variation.\n  - Background from \\( t\\bar{t} \\) was also estimated from simulation (POWHEG/MG5_aMC+Pythia8), normalized to NNLO cross sections, with an uncertainty ignored as <1% of the total sample.\n  - Background from \\( W+\\text{jets} \\) was estimated from simulation (Pythia8), normalized to NNLO cross sections, with a systematic uncertainty from a 3.2% cross-section variation.\n\n- **Event Regions**:\n  - High-purity \\( t\\bar{t} \\) control region for b jet M_SV template (lepton+≥2 jets, ≥1 b-tagged jet).\n  - Particle-level fiducial phase space.\n  - Semileptonic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) validation sample for c jet M_SV template (muon+≥4 jets).\n  - W+jets validation sample for light-jet M_SV template (muon+≥1 jet).\n  - Z+HF jets sample (HF-tagged region).\n  - Z+jets baseline selection region.\n\n- **Object Selections**:\n  - Jets with \\( p_T > 30 \\) GeV, \\( |eta| < 2.4 \\) identified via HF tagging (CSVv2, medium operating point, ~10% c-jet tagging efficiency, 1% light-jet mistag), matched to a generated c hadron and not a b hadron.\n  - Jets with \\( p_T > 30 \\) GeV, \\( |eta| < 2.4 \\) identified via HF tagging (CSVv2, medium operating point, ~60% b-jet tagging efficiency, 1% light-jet mistag), matched to a generated b hadron.\n  - Opposite-charge, same-flavor lepton pair with \\( 71 < m_{ll} < 111 \\) GeV.\n  - Electrons with \\( p_T > 25 \\) GeV, \\( |eta| < 2.4 \\), isolation < 25% of lepton \\( p_T \\), \\( |d_{xy}| < 0.05 \\) cm, \\( |d_z| < 0.2 \\) cm, exactly two same-flavor electrons required.\n  - Muons with \\( p_T > 25 \\) GeV, \\( |eta| < 2.4 \\), isolation < 25% of lepton \\( p_T \\), \\( |d_{xy}| < 0.05 \\) cm, \\( |d_z| < 0.2 \\) cm, exactly two same-flavor muons required.\n  - At least one jet with \\( p_T > 30 \\) GeV, \\( |eta| < 2.4 \\) required per event.\n  - Missing transverse energy \\( p_T^{\\text{miss}} < 40 \\) GeV.\n  - Stable Z-decay leptons dressed with photons within \\( \\Delta R < 0.1 \\); fiducial requirement \\( p_T > 25 \\) GeV, \\(", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Cross section ratio R(c/b) = σ(Z+c jets)/σ(Z+b jets)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.488}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 81, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}, {"ro