{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-841f7cfe", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Muon?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object Muon:\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2109.13808**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson properties using $WW^{*}(\\rightarrow e\\nu\\mu\\nu)jj$ production in $36.1\\text{\\,}{\\mathrm{fb}}^{-1}$ of $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{t}}}}}}}{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{b}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2401.05299**: \"Three leptons ($3\\ell$)\"\n- **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2503.19420**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2504.13081**: \"General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state\"\n- **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Muon", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 33, "error": null, "seconds": 0.262}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 95, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:final_state:3l", "hepkg:final_