{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-844bfac6", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Control-region mistag-rate extrapolation method (Eq. 4) to estimate SR background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using the \"Control-region mistag-rate extrapolation method (Eq. 4) to estimate SR background\":\n\n- **2004.14060**: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2511.11853**: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state\n\nThese papers report results that estimate backgrounds using the specified method.\n\nAnswering your question, the graph contains the following analyses that estimate a background using the \"Control-region mistag-rate extrapolation method (Eq. 4) to estimate SR background\":\n\n- **2004.14060**\n- **2202.08676**\n- **2208.12095**\n- **2308.02285**\n- **2401.05299**\n- **2503.19420**\n- **2511.11853**\n- **2602.18611**\n- **2604.27044**\n\nThese are the distinct papers that use the specified method for background estimation.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate a background using the 'Control-region mistag-rate extrapolation method (Eq. 4) to estimate SR background':\\n- **2004.14060**: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\\\bar{t} \\\\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- **2202.086", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Control-region mistag-rate extrapolation method (Eq. 4)", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.443}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_method", "object_set": 