{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-84d8e7b6", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Fractional purity of a targeted SM background process in a control/validation region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 13 analyses that measured Fractional purity of a targeted SM background process in a control/validation region. Here are some of the specific results and the papers that measured them:\n\n1. **Result**: Acceptance x efficiency, Wh SFOS(0j,nj)/DFOS regions, m(NLSP)=200 GeV, massless chi10\n   - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n2. **Result**: Acceptance x efficiency, off-shell WZ regions, m(NLSP)=200 GeV, Delta m=20 GeV\n   - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n3. **Result**: Acceptance x efficiency, off-shell WZ regions, m(NLSP)=200 GeV, Delta m=60 GeV\n   - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n4. **Result**: Acceptance x efficiency, on-shell WZ 0j/nj regions, m(NLSP)=600 GeV, massless chi10\n   - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n5. **Result**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)\n   - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n6. **Result**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n   - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n7. **Result**: Data deficit: SR^WZ-5\n   - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n8. **Result**: Data deficit: SR^offWZ_highMET-0j-f2\n   - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n9. **Result**: Data excess: SR^Wh_DFOS-1\n   - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n10. **Result**: Diboson normalisation factor, CR3l-ISR-VV (RJR ISR selection)\n    - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n11. **Result**: Diboson normalisation factor, CR3l-VV (RJR low-mass selection)\n    - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n12. **Result**: Discovery-fit model-independent result for SR3l-ISR\n    - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\n13. **Result**: Discovery-fit model-independent result for SR3l-Low\n    - **Paper**: [Not specified in the graph]\n\nTo provide the exact papers, I will now retrieve the papers associated with these results.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"papers_of\", \"arguments\": {\"entity_ids\": [\"hepkg:result:accepteff-onshell-wh\", \"hepkg:result:accepteff-offwz-dm20\", \"hepkg:result:accepteff-offwz-dm60\", \"hepkg:result:accepteff-onshell-wz\", \"hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437\", \"hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556\", \"hepkg:result:deviation-wz-5\", \"hepkg:result:deviation-offwz-highmet-0jf2\", \"hepkg:result:deviation-wh-dfos1\", \"hepkg:result:diboson-norm-rjr-isr\", \"hepkg:result:diboson-norm-rjr-lowmass\", \"hepkg:result:rjr-sr3l-isr-discovery\", \"hepkg:result:rjr-sr3l-low-discovery", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2111.08340", "2206.09466", "2307.01094", "2403.01556", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Fractional purity of a targeted SM background process in a control/validation region", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "seconds": 0.391}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 64, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:background-purity-fraction", "hepkg:observable:background_rejection_factor", "hepkg:observable:background_yield_signal_region", "hepkg:observable:diboson-bac