{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-860be542", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background QCD multijet background (bbbb resolved, 4b region)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the QCD multijet background (bbbb resolved, 4b region):\n\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2405.18661**: CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement\n- **2405.18661**: CMS four top quark (tttt) production measurement\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bb tautau analysis result\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bb gamgam analysis result\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "QCD multijet background bbbb resolved 4b region", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 46, "error": null, "seconds": 0.349}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 75, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:fourtop_measurement", "hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbgamgam", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee"]}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_ttbar", "hepkg:background:bbbb_resolved_qcd_mul