{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-86a4f6ab", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring AK4 b-tagged jet (veto jet, DeepJet)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define regions that require an AK4 b-tagged jet (veto jet, DeepJet):\n\n1. **\"Had\" region** - Requires at least 2 jets, including additional jets beyond the required b-tagged jet.\n2. **$t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)** - Requires 1 b-tagged jet.\n3. **0-lepton channel signal region (SR)** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n4. **0L, 0 S-jet category** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n5. **0L, 1 S-jet category** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n6. **0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n7. **1 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ)** - Requires 1 b-tagged jet.\n8. **1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)** - Requires 1 or 2 b-tagged jets.\n9. **1-lepton channel signal region (SR)** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n10. **12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)** - Requires H-tagged large-R jets (H to bb).\n11. **1L, 0 S-jet category** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n12. **1L, 1 S-jet category** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n13. **2-lepton channel signal region (SR)** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n14. **2L, 0 S-jet category** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n15. **2ℓ SS Fiducial Region** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n16. **2ℓ SS Signal Region** - Requires at least 1 b-tagged jet with a leading \\( p_T \\) > 45 GeV.\n17. **2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions** - Requires 1 or 2 b-tagged jets.\n\nThese regions are defined in various analyses, and the specific requirements for each region are detailed in the corresponding papers. For more detailed information, you can refer to the specific papers that define these regions. \n\nTo provide the exact papers, I will now retrieve the papers associated with these regions.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"papers_of\", \"arguments\": {\"entity_ids\": [\"hepkg:region:had\", \"hepkg:region:CR-ttbar\", \"hepkg:region:0lep_sr\", \"hepkg:region:0l-0j\", \"hepkg:region:0l-1j\", \"hepkg:region:0l-5j\", \"hepkg:region:sr-1b\", \"hepkg:region:1lep_cr_mj\", \"hepkg:region:1lep_sr\", \"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "AK4 b-tagged jet (veto jet, DeepJet)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 53, "error": null, "seconds": 0.409}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 489, "error": nu