{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-87a42f82", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background DPS (double parton scattering) di-charmonium background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate the background DPS (double parton scattering) di-charmonium background:\\n- 2004.14060: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2010.14293: Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb -1 of $\\\\sqrt{s}$ =13 TeV $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2012.03799: Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\penalty 10000\\\\ \\\\mathrm{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2102.01444: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2106.01676: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2207.12246: Measurement of the total cross section and $\\\\rho$ -parameter from elastic scattering in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2211.08028: Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more $b$ -jets in 139 fb -1 of proton–proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2302.05225: Searches for lepton-flavour-violating decays of the Higgs boson into $e\\\\tau$ and $\\\\mu\\\\tau$ in $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$  TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2304.08962: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2401.07090: Test of lepton flavor universality in ${\\\\mathup{{{{\\\\mathup{{{B}}}}}}^{\\\\scriptstyle{\\\\pm}}}}\\\\!\\\\to\\\\!{\\\\mathup{{{{\\\\mathup{{{K}}}}}}^{\\\\scriptstyle{\\\\pm}}}}{\\\\mathup{{}^{\\\\scriptstyle{+}}}}{\\\\mathup{{}^{\\\\scriptstyle{-}}}}$ and ${\\\\mathup{{{{\\\\mathup{{{B}}}}}}^{\\\\scriptstyle{\\\\pm}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "DPS di-charmonium", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.284}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 27, "error": null, "seconds": 0.029}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:de78c3f754afbc4965051e45", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2", "hepkg:resul