{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-87fb3631", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Data-driven control-region-based transfer factor method for V+jets background estimation (Z(ll), W(lν), γ+jets CRs with simulation-derived transfer factors)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using the Data-driven control-region-based transfer factor method for V+jets background estimation (Z(ll), W(lν), γ+jets CRs with simulation-derived transfer factors):\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $W$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets and W+jets backgrounds.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$ (semileptonic/dileptonic), $W$+jets, and $Z$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, $Wt$ single-top, $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$, and \"Others\" minor backgrounds.\n- **2106.01676**: Estimates SM WZ, $t\\bar{t}$, and $Z$+jets (FNP-lepton) backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets (primarily Z→tautau) and non-resonant WW diboson backgrounds.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $W{+}\\text{jets}$ and $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates $t t̄$, $W$+jets, and $Z$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates top quark-antiquark (ttbar) and diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) backgrounds.\n\nThese analyses use various control-region-based transfer factor methods to estimate the backgrounds, including the specific method mentioned in the question.\n\nAnswering from the graph, the above list is complete for the given method. If there are any additional analyses that use this method, they are not recorded in the current graph.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\