{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-8811d8c9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Jet energy resolution uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"Jet energy resolution uncertainty\":\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n\nThese are the distinct papers that report the systematic uncertainty \"Jet energy resolution uncertainty.\"\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Jet energy resolution uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.347}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 118, "error": null, "seconds": 0.055}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19"]}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:syst:hcal_inefficiency", "hepkg:syst:jer", "hepkg:syst:jes", "hepkg:syst:jet_calibration_group", "hepkg:syst:jet_energy_resolution", "hepkg:syst:jet_energy_scale", "hepkg:systematic:b-jet-efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:b_jet_tagging", "hepkg:systematic:beam_energy", "hepkg:systematic:btag-calibration", "hepkg:systematic:electron-energy-momentum-scale-resolution", "hepkg:systematic:electron-energy-scale", "hepkg:systematic:electron-energy-scale-resolution", "hepkg:systematic:electron_energy_scale", "hepkg:sys