{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-89045c8e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Limited size of simulated (MC) samples uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"Limited size of simulated (MC) samples uncertainty\":\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.07090**: Integrated \\( B(B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ \\mu^+ \\mu^-) \\) in 1.1 < \\( q^2 \\) < 6.0 GeV^2 and over the full \\( q^2 \\) range (model-extrapolated, flavio/superiso)\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\nThese analyses have reported the systematic uncertainty related to the limited size of simulated (MC) samples.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Limited size of simulated (MC) samples uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.378}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 84, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce