{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-8b12414e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample MadGraph5_aMC@NLO+Herwig 7.1.3 (alternative $t\\bar t$ generator)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample MadGraph5_aMC@NLO+Herwig 7.1.3 (alternative $t\\bar t$ generator):\n\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of $t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS Z+jets differential cross section measurement (jet multiplicity) at 13 TeV.\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2405.18661", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "MadGraph5_aMC@NLO+Herwig 7.1.3", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.43}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 61, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:zjets_differential_13tev", "hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:diboson-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:drell_yan_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:drellyan_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:eft2obs_reweighting_sample", "hepkg:sample:gammajets_vbf_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:ggf-alt-mg5", "hepkg:sample:ggh-madgraph-nlo", "hepkg:sample:ggh_vbf_tth_signal_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:hh-vbf-lo-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:qcd_multijet_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:signal_bsm_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:signal_mc_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:singletop_schannel_mg5amc", "hepkg:sample:sm-ggh-mg5amcnlo-nnlops", "hepkg:sample:sm-nonggh-mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:smeft_lo_signal