{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-8d87d96c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured H -> ZZ -> 4 leptons?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured H -> ZZ -> 4 leptons:\n\n- 2103.04956: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2110.11231: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- 2206.09466: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- 2408.03744: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\n- 2504.13081: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2508.13900: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2510.07527: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2602.18611: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.04956", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2312.04450", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "H -> ZZ -> 4l", "kind": "channel"}, "rows": 33, "error": null, "seconds": 0.317}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_final_state", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 37, "error": null, "seconds": 0.015}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:channel:4l", "hepkg:channel:4l_h", "hepkg:channel:4l_i", "hepkg:channel:diboson_bkg", "hepkg:channel:h_to_tautau", "hepkg:channel:zh_lep_diphoton", "hepkg:final_state:0-lepton", "hepkg:final_state:4l", "hepkg:final_state:enumunu_jj", "hepkg:final_state:four_lepton", "hepkg:final_state:fourlepton-met", "hepkg:final_state:h_to_bb", "hepkg:final_state:h_to_gammagamma", "hepkg:final_state:h_to_invisible", "hepkg:final_state:h_to_mumu", "hepkg:final_state:h_to_tautau", "hepkg:final_state:h_to_ww_lvlv", "hepkg:final_state:h_to_zgamma_llgamma", "hepkg:final_state:h_to_zz_4l", "hepkg:fina