{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-93886b9f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using ABCD data-driven background estimation method?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 45 distinct analyses that estimate backgrounds using the ABCD data-driven background estimation method or related methods. These analyses cover a variety of backgrounds, including $Z$+jets, $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and others. Here are some of the papers that use these methods:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates backgrounds for $Z \\to \\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and $t\\bar{t}+Z$.\n- **2007.02873**: Estimates the $Z$+jets background.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates the $Z$+jets and $W$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates the $t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}+Z$, $W$+jets, and $Z$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates the $t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}Z$, $Wt$, and $Z/\\gamma^*+\\mathrm{jets}$ backgrounds, as well as minor backgrounds.\n- **2106.01676**: Estimates the $Z$+jets and $t\\bar{t}$ backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates the $Z/\\gamma^*+\\mathrm{jets}$ and $WW$ backgrounds.\n- **2110.11231**: Estimates the $VVV$ triboson background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates the $W$+jets and $Z$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates the $t\\bar{t}$ background.\n\nThese analyses collectively demonstrate the widespread use of the ABCD data-driven background estimation method in various contexts within high-energy physics.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "22