tate with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( \\mathup{W} \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( \\mathup{W} \\) and \\( \\mathup{Z} \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13  TeV.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2402.08486", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "DPE MBR", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 26, "error": null, "seconds": 0.253}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 59, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed17