on collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( \\mathup{{{b}}} \\) final state.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Diboson production sample (single-lepton channel, pythia8 generated)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.503}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 100, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:diboson", "hepkg:sample:diboson-m