{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-94ecaaf2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Diboson ($WW$, $ZZ$, $WZ$) MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1/2.2.2)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the Diboson ($WW$, $ZZ$, $WZ$) MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1/2.2.2):\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a $Z$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential $WZ$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of $t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13 TeV.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n\nThese analyses utilized the Diboson ($WW$, $ZZ$, $WZ$) MC sample generated with Sherpa 2.2.1/2.2.2.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses used the Diboson ($WW$, $ZZ$, $WZ$) MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1/2.2.2):\\n\\n- **2001.068", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Diboson (WW, ZZ, WZ) MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1/2.2.2)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.538}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 85, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b7