{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-952fc474", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Combined LFV Yukawa coupling sqrt(|Y_tau e|^2+|Y_e tau|^2)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the Combined LFV Yukawa coupling \\( \\sqrt{|Y_{\\tau e}|^2 + |Y_{e \\tau}|^2} \\):\n\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2503.19420**: Compatibility test of observed \\( \\mu_{WH} \\) and \\( \\mu_{ZH} \\) with each other and with the Standard Model.\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2602.18611**: Coupling modifier ratio fit.\n- **2604.27044**: Combined Run 3 resolved+merged \\( HH \\rightarrow 4b \\) result.\n- **2604.27044**: Combined Run 2 + Run 3 \\( HH \\rightarrow 4b \\) result.\n\nThese papers cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson production, top quark pair production, and compatibility tests with the Standard Model. Each of these analyses contributes to the understanding of the Combined LFV Yukawa coupling \\( \\sqrt{|Y_{\\tau e}|^2 + |Y_{e \\tau}|^2} \\).\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.14537", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2207.00348", "2302.05225", "2309.14442", "2402.08486", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2508.13900", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Combined LFV Yukawa coupling sqrt(|Y_tau e|^2+|Y_e tau|^2)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 58, "error": null, "seconds": 0.501}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 78, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3", "hepkg:result:combined-run3", "hepkg:result:muwh-zh-compatibility", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:coupling_modifier_ratios", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe"]}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:HT_jets", "hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cb-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cw-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cwww-observable", "hepkg:observable:br_diff_mutau_etau", "hepkg:observable:br_h_etau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_e_tau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "hepkg:observable:coupling_mu_tau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_symmetry_leptonquark", "hepkg:observable:coupling_symmetry_updown", "hepkg:observable:deltaR_bbextra", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "hepkg:observable:eta_ll_vs_m_ll", "hepkg:observable:eta_ll_vs_pt_ll", "hepkg:observable:fiducial-cross-section-ee-plus-p", "hepkg:observable:fiducial-cross-section-mumu-plus-p", "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_no_dihiggs", "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_quadratic", "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_with_dihiggs", "hepkg:observable:higgs_self_coupling_modifier", "hepkg:observable:individual_warsaw_coeff_constraints", "hepkg:observable:kappa-2V", "hepkg:observable:kappa-lambda", "hepkg:observable:m_ttbar_vs_dphi_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:m_ttbar_vs_yabs_top", "hepkg:observable:m_ttbar_vs_yabs_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:mediator-mass-coupling-exclusion", "hepkg:observable:mu-h-fiducial"