{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-99329371", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Combined LFV Yukawa coupling sqrt(|Y_tau mu|^2+|Y_mu tau|^2)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 21 distinct analyses that measured the Combined LFV Yukawa coupling \\(\\sqrt{|Y_{\\tau \\mu}|^2 + |Y_{\\mu \\tau}|^2}\\) or related observables. Here are some of the specific analyses:\n\n1. **$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector**\n2. **Combination and Interpretation of Differential Higgs Boson Production Cross Sections in Proton-Proton Collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$**\n3. **Combination of Searches for Nonresonant Higgs Boson Pair Production in Proton-Proton Collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$**\n4. **Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b Result**\n5. **Combined Run 3 Resolved+Merged HH->4b Result**\n6. **Compatibility Test of Observed $\\mu_{WH}$ and $\\mu_{ZH}$ with Each Other and with the SM**\n7. **Coupling Modifier Ratio Fit**\n8. **Differential Branching Fraction Measurement of $B^+ \\to K^+ \\mu^+ \\mu^-$ Across 15 $q^2$ Bins**\n9. **Differential Cross Section Measurements for the Production of Top Quark Pairs and of Additional Jets Using Dilepton Events from $pp$ Collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$**\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson properties, top quark interactions, and differential cross sections. If you need more details on any specific analysis, please let me know.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2302.05225", "2309.14442", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2503.19420", "2504.13081