 \"Single-top ($tW$) cross-section, DR/DS scheme, PS/hadronisation and ISR/FSR uncertainty\"\n\n6. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark**\n   - Systematic uncertainty: \"Single-top ($tW$) cross-section, DR/DS scheme, PS/hadronisation and ISR/FSR uncertainty\"\n\n7. **Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons**\n   - Systematic uncertainty: \"Single-top ($tW$) cross-section, DR/DS scheme, PS/hadronisation and ISR/FSR uncertainty\"\n\n8. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**\n   - Systematic uncertainty: \"Single-top ($tW$) cross-section, DR/DS scheme, PS/hadronisation and ISR/FSR uncertainty\"\n\n9. **HH->bbWW, WW->lvqq/2l2nu analysis result**\n   - Systematic uncertainty: \"Single-top ($tW$) cross-section, DR/DS scheme, PS/hadronisation and ISR/FSR uncertainty\"\n\n10. **HH->multilepton analysis result**\n    - Systematic uncertainty: \"Single-top ($tW$) cross-section, DR/DS scheme, PS/hadronisation and ISR/FSR uncertainty\"\n\n11. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state**\n    - Systematic uncertainty: \"Single-top ($tW$) cross-section, DR/DS scheme, PS/hadronisation and ISR/FSR uncertainty\"\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics including Higgs boson production, top quark pair production, and various other processes involving the Higgs boson and top qu", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": 