{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-9d8a27d0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Resolved κ model (κ_V, κ_F scan)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph contains several analyses that constrain models related to the κ-framework, which includes the \"κ-framework (Higgs boson coupling modifier model)\". Here are the analyses that measured or constrained this model:\n\n1. **$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector**\n2. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**\n3. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**\n4. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark**\n5. **Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons**\n6. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state**\n7. **Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment**\n8. **Measurement of the total cross section and $\\rho$ -parameter from elastic scattering in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**\n9. **Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**\n10. **Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $W$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**\n11. **Search for dark QCD with emerging jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**\n12. **Search for dark matter produced in association with a dark Higgs boson in the $b\\bar{b}$ final state using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**\n13. **Search for invisible decays of the Higgs boson produced via vector boson fusion in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**\n14. **Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**\n15. **Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**\n16. **Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector**\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics including Higgs boson properties, production cross sections, and searches for new physics beyond the Standard Model.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\",", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2312.04450", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Resolved κ model (κ_V, κ_F scan)", "kind": "bsm_model"}, "rows": 47, "error": null, "seconds": 0.351}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_co