{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-9fc1e891", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Anomalous coupling c_b/Lambda^2 constraint from M(WZ) tail?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph does not contain any specific entries for the parameter \\( c_b/\\Lambda^2 \\). However, it does show that several analyses constrain various anomalous couplings, including those related to the \\( M(WZ) \\) tail. Here are the analyses that constrain models involving anomalous couplings:\n\n1. **Higgs boson trilinear self-coupling constraint via NLO EW corrections** (`hepkg:result:higgs_selfcoupling_fit`)\n2. **Search for anomalous WWZ triple gauge couplings (EFT parameter limits)** (`hepkg:result:atgc-search`)\n3. **Effective coupling modifier fit with B_inv, B_undet floating and |kappa_V|<=1 constraint** (`hepkg:result:coupling_effective_binv_kv1`)\n4. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (`hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b`)\n5. **Effective coupling modifier fit assuming no additional BSM decays** (`hepkg:result:coupling_effective_bsm0`)\n6. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (`hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044`)\n7. **2HDM and hMSSM benchmark exclusion from coupling modifier fits** (`hepkg:result:2hdm_hmssm_exclusion`)\n8. **\\( \\kappa_c \\) 95% CL interval from \\( t\\bar{t}H \\) channel alone (kappa_b fixed to SM)** (`hepkg:result:kappa_c_ttH_only`)\n9. **CMS top quark Yukawa coupling limit from four top quark production** (`hepkg:result:fourtop_yt_limit`)\n10. **Wino/bino(+) WZ-mediated exclusion, Delta m near mZ (on-shell WZ selection)** (`hepkg:result:excl-winobinoplus-wz-deltammz`)\n11. **\\( A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}} \\) vs \\( \\Delta R_{\\ell b, \\, \\textrm{lead}} \\) result** (`hepkg:result:acrel-drlb`)\n12. **Acceptance x efficiency, off-shell WZ regions, m(NLSP)=200 GeV, Delta m=20 GeV** (`hepkg:result:accepteff-offwz-dm20`)\n13. **Acceptance x efficiency, off-shell WZ regions, m(NLSP)=200 GeV, Delta m=60 GeV** (`hepkg:result:accepteff-offwz-dm60`)\n14. **Higgsino WZ-mediated exclusion, Delta m=30-60 GeV** (`hepkg:result:excl-higgsino-dm30-60`)\n15. **Wino/bino(-) WZ-mediated exclusion, Delta m around 80 GeV** (`hepkg:result:excl-winobinominus-dm80`)\n16. **Resolved Higgs boson coupling modifier fit** (`hepkg:result:coupling_resolved`)\n17. **WZ normalisation factor, CR^WZ_WZ 0j (on-shell WZ/Wh combined fit)** (`hepkg:result:wz-norm-onshell-0j`)\n18. **WZ normalisation factor, CR^WZ_WZ low-HT (on-shell W", "answered": true, "papers": ["2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2205.05120", "2401.05299", "2405.18661", "2509.22535", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Anomalous coupling c_b/Lambda^2 constraint from M(WZ) tail", "kind": "result"}, "rows": 26, "error": null, "seconds": 0.435}, {"round": 2, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_set": "set_1", "predicate": "result_reports_quantity"}, "rows": 62, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_reports_quantity", "object_ids": ["hepkg:parameter:cb-lambda2"]}, "rows": 0, "error": "unknown_entity_id", "seconds": 0.0}, {"round": 4, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "c_b/Lambda^2", "kind": "parameter"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "seconds": 0.269}, {"round": 5, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_set": "set_1", "predicate": "result_constrains_model"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.015}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:result:2hdm_hmssm_exclusion", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:52d0213216b446bc782fa4dc"