{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-a05a17cf", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured STXS Stage 1.2 fiducial cross-sections $\\sigma\\times\\mathcal{B}_{H\\to WW^{*}}$ ($\\ell\\nu H$, $\\ell\\ell H$, EW $qqH$ categories)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured STXS Stage 1.2 fiducial cross-sections \\(\\sigma \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) (\\(\\ell\\nu H\\), \\(\\ell\\ell H\\), EW \\(qqH\\) categories):\n\n- **2110.11231**: Fiducial WZ production cross section measurement (combined flavour categories)\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\to b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}\\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}Z\\) production in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Fiducial \\(t\\bar{t}W\\) cross-section measurement result, \\(\\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{+})\\) measurement result, \\(\\sigma(t\\bar{t}W^{-})\\) measurement result\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV\n- **2404.06204**: Fiducial cross sections extrapolated to CMS phase space (Table 11), Fiducial cross-section ratios extrapolated to CMS phase space (Table 12)\n- **2503.19420**: 95% CL upper limit on POI for \\(\\ell\\ell H\\), \\(p_T^V \\geq 150\\) GeV category (STXS scheme)\n\nThese analyses cover a range of processes and final states related to the STXS Stage 1