{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-a47f648c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Unresolved κ model (κ, κ_g scan)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph contains several analyses that mention models related to the \"κ_b–κ_t–c_g model\" (which is similar to the \"Unresolved κ model (κ, κ_g scan)\"). Here are the analyses:\n\n1. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8`)\n2. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044`)\n3. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b`)\n4. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878`)\n5. **Measurement of the total cross section and \\( \\rho \\)-parameter from elastic scattering in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:de78c3f754afbc4965051e45`)\n6. **Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12`)\n7. **Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c`)\n8. **Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\( pp \\) Collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS Detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:1b05d75dca9cf140bac022d5`)\n9. **Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a \\( Z \\) Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV \\( pp \\) Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:dd53bd1f0b8e16150e060072`)\n10. **Search for dark QCD with emerging jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:6bc442f4b330b7ddaa82ac31`)\n11. **Search for supersymmetry in final states with two oppositely charged same-flavor leptons and missing transverse momentum in proton-proton collisions at \\(", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2312.04450", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Unresolved κ model (κ, κ_g scan)", "kind": "bsm_model"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.346}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_mentions_model", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:model:bbll-ci", "hepkg:model:bsll-ci", "hepkg:model:compete_hpr1r2", "hepkg:model:composite-higgs", "hepkg:model:composite_higgs", "hepkg:model:coupling_modifier_framework", "hepkg:model:dim6top", "hepkg:model:dm-pseudoscalar-mediator-ttbar", "hepkg:model:dm-scalar-mediator-ttbar", "hepkg: