{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-a55105b3", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Scalar pT sum of all b jets (H_T^b)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the scalar pT sum of all b jets (H_T^b):\n\n1. **$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector** (arXiv: 2004.04545)\n2. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector** (arXiv: 2111.08340)\n3. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$** (arXiv: 2402.08486)\n4. **95% CL upper limit on POI for VH, p_T^V>=250 GeV category (p_T^V scheme)** (arXiv: 2503.19420)\n5. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$** (arXiv: 2504.13081)\n\nThese are the distinct papers that have results measuring the scalar pT sum of all b jets (H_T^b).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2009.04363", "2103.04956", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2302.05225", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2402.08486", "2503.19420", "2504.13081"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Scalar pT sum of all b jets H_T^b", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.353}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 87, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "