{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-a7ab9cdc", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Signal region SR^Z_1A (3ℓ selection, t̃1→tχ̃2⁰ with χ̃2⁰→h/Zχ̃1⁰, large mass splitting)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Signal region SR^Z_1A (3ℓ selection, t̃1→tχ̃2⁰ with χ̃2⁰→h/Zχ̃1⁰, large mass splitting)\":\n\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02\\, \\text{TeV} \\) and \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\nThese papers cover a range of topics including Higgs boson production, \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production, and various other processes involving vector bosons and fermions.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2304.08962", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Signal region SR^Z_1A (3ℓ selection, t̃1→tχ̃2⁰ with χ̃2⁰→h/Zχ̃1⁰, large mass splitting)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.602}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 44, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc