{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-a88347aa", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Simulated diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) sample (PYTHIA 8, version 8.219)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"Simulated diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) sample (PYTHIA 8, version 8.219)\":\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\\\rightarrow\\\\gamma\\\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2303.15340**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\;$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2408.03744**: \"Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\"\n- **2508.13900**: \"General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Simulated diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) sample (PYTHIA 8, version 8.219)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.518}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 94, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:resul