{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-aa4cbdc1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Forward jet?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring a forward jet:\n\n- **2004.04545** - Defines the \"Had\" region.\n- **2007.02873** - Defines the 0-lepton, 1-lepton, and 2-lepton channel signal regions, as well as the 1-lepton channel multi-jet control region.\n- **2106.14246** - Defines the 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20).\n- **2401.05299** - Defines the 2ℓ SS Signal Region, 2ℓ SS Fiducial Region, 2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions, and 2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions.\n- **2506.13565** - Defines the 1 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ).\n- **2508.13900** - Defines multiple categories including 0L, 0 S-jet, 0L, 1 S-jet, 0L, ≥5 S-jet, 1L, 0 S-jet, 1L, 1 S-jet, and 2L, 0 S-jet.\n\nThese analyses cover a variety of regions that require forward jets in their definitions.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args