{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ad20e7ba", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the generator GENEVA?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the generator GENEVA or related generators:\n\n- 2001.06899: Alternative Z+jets sample with Herwig++ parton shower/hadronization model (systematic variation)\n- 2007.02873: Alternative ttbar parton-shower sample (Powheg+Herwig7), Alternative Wt parton-shower sample (Powheg+Herwig++), Alternative diboson sample (Powheg+Herwig++)\n- 2009.04363: Zjj-EW background MC sample\n- 2009.14537: Single-dissociative photon-fusion signal MC sample, pp->p(γγ→ℓ+ℓ-)p*\n- 2208.12095: Protos MC sample with heavy axigluon (CTEQ6L1 PDF)\n- 2405.18661: Nonperturbative correction simulation for fiducial jet cross sections, NP correction for 13 TeV jet cross section (herwig++ EE5C / pythia8 CP1 average), GENEVA NNLO ME + NNLL beam-thrust resummation, Z+jets, Multi-generator predictions for inelastic pp cross section (pythia6.4/8, phojet, QGSJET-II, sibyll, epos)\n- 2604.21670: Charged-current Drell-Yan W production sample (Powheg Box, NLO, CT10 PDF), SM and SMEFT electroweak precision observable predictions (ewpd4lhc)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2208.12095", "2405.18661", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "GENEVA", "kind": "generator"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.211}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "sample_uses_generator", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:wt_alt_ps", "hepkg:sample:zjets_herwigpp_altps", "hepkg:sample:diboson_alt_powheg_herwigpp", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_alt_ps", "hepkg:sample:hmdy_