{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-b37c54b1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Normalization to data in dedicated control regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using normalization to data in dedicated control regions:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $W$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2007.02873**: Estimates Z+jets background.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets and W+jets backgrounds.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates ttbar (semileptonic/dileptonic), W+jets, and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, $Wt$ single-top, Z+jets, and \"Others\" minor backgrounds.\n- **2106.01676**: Estimates Z+jets, WZ, and ttbar backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets and non-resonant WW diboson backgrounds.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $W{+}\\text{jets}$ and $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates t t̄, W+jets, and Z+jets backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Normalization to data in dedicated con