{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-b37cf96b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background γ+jets background (dominant SM background)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background γ+jets background (dominant SM background):\n\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2008.05928**: Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\( pp \\) Collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS Detector.\n- **2103.06956**: Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bb gamgam analysis result.\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the \\( \\ell \\nu b \\) final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson production, top quark production, and searches for new physics. Each of these analyses explicitly estimates the γ+jets background.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "γ+jets", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.274}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 43, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbgamgam", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620