{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-b5b46f9f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 3ℓF search regions (F01–F12)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"3ℓF search regions (F01–F12)\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2004.01678**: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a \\( Z \\) Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV \\( pp \\) Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n- **2107.12553**: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) bosons using 137 \\( \\, \\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( \\mathup{{{W}}}\\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( \\mathup{{{p}}}\\mathup{{{p}}} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H \\to \\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) and \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13  TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "3ℓF search regions (F01–F12)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.386}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 59, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:9d25af