{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-b6f36293", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring AK4 jet (anti-kT, R=0.4)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring an AK4 jet (anti-kT, R=0.4):\n\n- **2004.01678**: Signal Region (SR)\n- **2004.04545**: \"Had\" region\n- **2007.02873**: \n  - 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)\n  - 2-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- **2012.01581**: Final signal region (Region H)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)\n- **2107.12553**: 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2111.08340**: $t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)\n- **2202.08676**: 3L ttZ control region\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2401.05299**: \n  - 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n  - 2ℓ SS Fiducial Region\n  - 3ℓ ttZ Control Region\n  - 2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions\n  - 2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions\n- **2503.19420**: \n  - 3-lepton WZ control region, 0 jets\n  - 3-lepton WZ control region, >=1 jet\n- **2506.13565**: 1 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ)\n- **2508.13900**: 0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)\n\nThese regions require various configurations of AK4 jets, including different counts, pT thresholds, and other criteria. For more detailed information on each region, refer to the specific papers.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", 