{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ba620593", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 3ℓ Signal Region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"3ℓ Signal Region\":\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $W$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n\nThese papers define the \"3ℓ Signal Region\" as part of their analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text":