{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-bc452c8d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region Validation region VR^{Z,n-jet}_VV for multi-boson background (jet multiplicity extrapolation)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The graph does not contain a specific entry for the region 'Validation region VR^{Z,n-jet}_VV for multi-boson background (jet multiplicity extrapolation)'. However, it lists several validation regions and multi-boson backgrounds. The closest match is the 'VR$^{3-body}_{VV}$: three-body diboson validation region', which is defined in the following analyses:\\n\\n- 'Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector'\\n- 'Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state'\\n- 'Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$'\\n- 'General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$'\\n- 'Measurement of the associated production of a $\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV'\\n- 'Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV'\\n- 'Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector'\\n- 'Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector'\\n- 'Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS'\\n- 'Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector'\\n- 'Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ TeV and $13$ TeV'\\n- 'Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in $pp$ Collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS Detector'\\n- 'Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ bosons using 137 $\\\\,\\\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$'\\n- 'Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector'\\n\\nThese analyses estimate various backgrounds, including multi", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, 