{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-bd5d09da", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 2L, >=2 S-jet category (inclusive)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"2L, >=2 S-jet category (inclusive)\":\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV in the \\(H\\to\\gamma\\gamma\\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(pp\\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}Z\\) production in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\)\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\)\n\nThese are the distinct papers that define the specified region.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.04363", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.14246", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "2L, >=2 S-jet catego