{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-bd8b7ed9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample gg->ZZ MCFM 7.0.1 LO background MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \\( gg \\to ZZ \\) MCFM 7.0.1 LO background MC sample:\n\n1. **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV.\n2. **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n3. **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV.\n4. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\to b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n5. **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV.\n6. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n7. **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\to t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n8. **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 5.02 \\) and 13 TeV.\n9. **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV.\n10. **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": 