{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-c25ed3b1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Continuum γγ+γj+jj background (gg→H, qq'→Hqq' categories)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background \"Continuum γγ+γj+jj background (gg→H, qq'→Hqq' categories)\":\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\\\rightarrow\\\\gamma\\\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"HH->bb gamgam analysis result\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"HH->multilepton analysis result\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"HH->gamgamtautau analysis result\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"HH->WWgamgam analysis result\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state\"\n- **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics related to Higgs boson interactions and production, including various final states and decay channels.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Continuum γγ+γj+jj background (gg→H, qq'→Hqq' categories)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.461}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 108, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:wwgamgam", "hepkg:result:bbgamgam", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:gamgamtautau", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878"]}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbgamgam_continuum", "hepkg:background:bbgamgam_singleH", "hepkg:background:bbww4q_top_vector_boson", "hepkg:background:combinatorial-background", "hepkg:background:continuum-gg-h-qqhqq", "hepkg:background:continuu