{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-c2cdca19", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the generator fewz v3.1 (NNLO cross section calculation tool)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The analysis with arXiv ID 2001.06899 used the generator FEWZ v3.1 (NNLO cross section calculation tool). This analysis focused on the measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV.\n\nKey aspects of this analysis include:\n\n- **Background Estimation**: \n  - The background from \\( t\\bar{t} \\) events was estimated from simulation (POWHEG+Pythia8), normalized to the NNLO cross section with soft-gluon resummation from top++ v2.0.\n  - The background from \\( W \\)-jets and other processes was estimated from simulation (POWHEG/MG5_aMC+Pythia8), normalized to NNLO cross sections.\n  - The background from multijet events was estimated from simulation (Pythia8), normalized to NNLO cross sections.\n\n- **Event Regions**:\n  - High-purity \\( t\\bar{t} \\) control region for b jet mass template.\n  - Particle-level fiducial phase space.\n  - Semileptonic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) validation sample for c jet mass template.\n  - W+jets validation sample for light-jet mass template.\n  - Z+HF jets sample (HF-tagged region).\n  - Z+jets baseline selection region.\n\n- **Object Selections**:\n  - Jets with \\( p_T > 30 \\) GeV and \\( |\\eta| < 2.4 \\) identified via HF tagging.\n  - Opposite-charge, same-flavor lepton pairs with \\( 71 < m_{ll} < 111 \\) GeV.\n  - Leptons with \\( p_T > 25 \\) GeV and \\( |\\eta| < 2.4 \\) with isolation requirements.\n  - Missing transverse energy \\( p_T^{\\text{miss}} < 40 \\) GeV.\n  - Stable Z-decay leptons dressed with photons within \\( \\Delta R < 0.1 \\).\n\nThis analysis provides a detailed study of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets, using the FEWZ v3.1 generator for the NNLO cross section calculations.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "fewz v3.1", "kind": "generator"}, "rows": 33, "error": null, "seconds": 0.307}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "sample_uses_generator", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.062}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:generator:fewz_v3p1"]}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}, {"round": 4, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2001.06899"]}, "rows": 102, "error": null, "seconds": 0.201}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:generator:evtgen", "hepkg:generator:evtgen-1.6.0", "hepkg:generator:evtgen-v1-6-0", "hepkg:generator:evtgen_1.6.0", "hepkg:generator:fewz", "hepkg:generator:fewz_v3p1", "hepkg:generator:herwig-7", "hepkg:generator:herwig-7-0-4", "hepkg:generator:herwig-7-2-1", "hepkg:generator:herwig-7.04", "hepkg:generator:herwig7", "hepkg:generator:herwig7_0_4", "hepkg:generator:herwig7_1_3", "hepkg:generator:madgraph5