{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-c39d68c9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Fiducial cross section extrapolated to the CMS fiducial phase-space definition?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the fiducial cross section extrapolated to the CMS fiducial phase-space definition:\n\n- **2110.11231**: Fiducial WZ production cross section measurement (combined flavour categories)\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}}{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Fiducial $t\\bar{t}W$ cross-section measurement result\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2404.06204**: Integrated fiducial cross-section measurement for W-, W+ and Z production at 5.02 and 13 TeV (Table 3)\n- **2404.06204**: Integrated fiducial cross-section ratios between processes at fixed sqrt(s) (Table 5)\n- **2404.06204**: Fiducial cross sections extrapolated to CMS phase space (Table 11)\n- **2404.06204**: Fiducial cross-section ratios extrapolated to CMS phase space (Table 12)\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2009.14537", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2504.13081"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Fiducial cross section extrapolated to the CMS fiducial phase-space definition", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.444}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 75, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:ttw-fiducial-xsec", "hepkg:result:wz-fiducial-xsec", "hepkg:result:cms-fiducial-xsec-table11", "hepkg:result:cms-fiducial-xsec-ratio-table12", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:integrated-fiducial-xsec-table3", "hepkg:result:integrated-xsec-ratio-process-table5"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:cms-fiducial-xsec", "hepkg:observable:cms-fiducial-xsec-ratio", "hepkg:observable:diff_el_cross_section", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_njet", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_jet", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "hepkg:observable:dm-xsec-upper-limit-ratio", "hepkg:observable:dsigma-deta-particle", "hepkg:observable:dsigma-deta-parton", "hepkg:observable:dsigma-dpt-particle", "hepkg:observable:eta_ll_vs_m_ll", "hepkg:observable:eta_ll_vs_pt_ll", "hepkg:observable:fid_dblratio_wz", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_w", "hepkg:observabl