{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-c3eabd1f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Single top quark background (s-, t-, tW channels)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background \"Single top quark background (s-, t-, tW channels)\":\n\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te}\\hskip-0.80002pt\\text{V}$\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te}\\hskip-0.80002pt\\text{V}$\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2405.18661**: CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement\n- **2405.18661**: CMS ttbar+Z0 (ttZ) associated production cross section measurement\n- **2405.18661**: CMS ttbar+W (ttW) associated production cross section measurement\n- **2405.18661**: CMS four top quark (tttt) production measurement\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result\n- **2510.07527**: HH->WWgamgam analysis result\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te}\\hskip-0.80002pt\\text{V}$\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including measurements of single top quark production, associated production of top quarks with other particles, and various Higgs boson processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Single top quark background (s-, t-, tW channels)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "seconds": 0.429}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 78, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:fourtop_measurement", "hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:ttw_measurement", "hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:wwgamgam", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd7