{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-c3ed7787", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Likelihood fit to Z->ee events (pT-|eta|) to measure electron charge misidentification rate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using the likelihood fit to \\( Z \\to ee \\) events (pT-\\(\\eta\\)) to measure electron charge misidentification rate:\n\n1. **2106.14246**: Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\).\n2. **2209.07327**: Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\).\n3. **2307.01094**: Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector.\n4. **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\) with the ATLAS detector.\n5. **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\).\n\nThese analyses specifically estimate the charge misidentification background using the likelihood fit to \\( Z \\to ee \\) events (pT-\\(\\eta\\)) to measure electron charge misidentification rate.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate a background using the likelihood fit to \\( Z \\\\to ee \\\\) events (pT-\\\\(\\\\eta\\\\)) to measure electron charge misidentification rate:\\n\\n1. **2106.14246**: Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\\\(\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{TeV}\\\\).\\n2. **2209.07327**: Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at \\\\(\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{TeV}\\\\).\\n3. **2307.01094**: Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector.\\n4. **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\\\( t\\\\bar{t}W \\\\) production in \\\\( pp \\\\) collisions at \\\\(\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{TeV}\\\\) with the ATLAS detector.\\n5. **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\\\( WW^{\\\\ast} \\\\) with the ATLAS detector at \\\\(\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{TeV}\\\\).\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Likelihood fit to Z->ee events (pT-|eta|) to measure electron charge misidentification rate", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 37, "error": null, "seconds": 0.449}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_method", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 73, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids":