{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-c51e4e31", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Pseudo-observable description of HVV couplings (kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured pseudo-observables related to HVV couplings (kappa_VV, epsilon_VV):\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2404.06204**: Compatibility test (chi2/dof) between \\( p_T^Z \\) measured via \\( p_T^{ll} \\) and via \\( u_T \\)\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2602.18611**: Effective coupling modifier fit assuming no additional BSM decays\n- **2602.18611**: Coupling modifier ratio fit\n- **2602.18611**: Higgs boson trilinear self-coupling constraint via NLO EW corrections\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n- **2604.27044**: Combined Run 3 resolved+merged \\( HH \\rightarrow 4b \\) result\n- **2604.27044**: Combined Run 2 + Run 3 \\( HH \\rightarrow 4b \\) result\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson decays, top quark production, and effective field theory interpretations.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2302.05225", "2309.14442", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2508.13900", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Pseudo-observable description of HVV couplings (kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 42, "error": null, "seconds": 0.429}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 58, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3", "hepkg:result:combined-run3", "hepkg:result:z-pt-validation-chi2", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:coupling_modifier_ratios", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_bsm0", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:higgs_selfcoupling_fit", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:atgc-cb-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cw-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cw-tilde-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cwww-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cwww-tilde-observable", "hepkg:observable:b_jet_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:c_jet_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:coupling_e_tau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "hepkg:observable:coupling_mu_tau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_symmetry_leptonquark", "hepkg:observable:coupling_symmetry_updown", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_njet", "hepkg:observable:eft_coefficient_constraints", "hepkg:observable:eta_b1_ext