ATLAS detector\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\,\\text{TeV}$ and $13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{*}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n\nThese papers cover the region \"3ℓ", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "3ℓC search regions (C01–C09)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.362}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 64, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702", "h