{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-c87e0c72", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Simulated WZ sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"Simulated WZ sample\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( \\mathup{{{W}}}\\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( \\mathup{{{p}}}\\mathup{{{p}}} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2112.00895**: Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=8\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) and \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13  TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the \"Simulated WZ sample\" in their analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Simulated WZ sample", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.326}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 106, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:result:98870936d56c0284b1c0a718"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.013}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hep