{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-c8cae0fb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Drell-Yan (DY) MC simulation sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the Drell-Yan (DY) MC simulation sample:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{Z} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( \\mathup{W}\\mathup{Z} \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( \\mathup{p}\\mathup{p} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\; \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS Z+jets differential cross section measurement (jet multiplicity) at 13 TeV.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS W and Z boson inclusive/fiducial/ratio cross section measurements (5, 7, 8, 13 TeV).\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n\nThese analyses are supported by the graph data.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Drell-Yan", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 46, "error": null, "seconds": 0.277}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 57, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:w_z_inclusive_fiducial_xsec", "hepkg:result:zjets_differential_13tev", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "h