{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-c90ca1fd", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty (7 independent sources)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 49 distinct analyses that report the systematic uncertainty \"Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty (7 independent sources)\" or related uncertainties. Here are some of the specific analyses and the exact systematic uncertainties they report:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n   - Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n\n2. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n\n3. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n   - Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n\n4. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n   - Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n\n5. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state**:\n   - Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n   - Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n\n6. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n   - Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n\n7. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n   - Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n\n8. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark**:\n   - Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics including Higgs boson production, top quark pair production, and constraints on anomalous couplings, all of which involve the systematic uncertainty related to the jet energy scale (JES).\n\nTo provide more detailed evidence, I can retrieve the specific sentences from the papers that mention these uncertainties. Would you like to see those quotes?", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty (7 independent sources)", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.438}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.059}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subject