{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-c94d580e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Data-driven mixed-data sample method for combinatorial background estimation?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph shows that several analyses estimate backgrounds using various methods, but it does not explicitly link the specific method \"Data-driven mixed-data sample method for combinatorial background estimation\" to any particular background estimation. \n\nHowever, we can list the analyses that estimate backgrounds using the methods that were found:\n\n1. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8`)\n2. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19`)\n3. **General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576`)\n4. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\(b\\) final state** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77`)\n5. **Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\(WZ\\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae`)\n6. **Measurement of the production cross section for a \\(W\\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee`)\n7. **Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\(t\\bar{t}W\\) production in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6`)\n8. **Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\(WW^{\\ast}\\) with the ATLAS detector at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e`)\n9. **Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2`)\n10. **Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\(t\\bar{t}\\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b`)\n\nThese analyses estimate backgrounds using various methods, but the specific method \"Data-driven", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Data-driven mixed-data sample method for combinatorial background estimation", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.482}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"pred