{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ca3c1070", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample QCD multijet background sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the QCD multijet background sample:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( \\mathup{{{W}}}\\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( \\mathup{{{p}}}\\mathup{{{p}}} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS inclusive fiducial jet production cross section measurements (2.76, 7, 8, 13 TeV).\n- **2405.18661**: CMS inclusive differential jet production cross section measurement at 13 TeV.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS Z+jets differential cross section measurement (jet multiplicity) at 13 TeV.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( \\mathup{{{b}}} \\) final state.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the QCD multijet background sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "QCD multijet", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 56, "error": null, "seconds": 0.272}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 64, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:zjets_differential_13tev", "hepkg:result:jet_differential_13tev", "hepkg:result:jet_fiducial_xsec", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:drellyan-madgraph-comparison", "hepkg:sample:dy_photon_jets_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:dyjets-mc", "hepkg:sample:ew_zjj_herwig_sample", "hepkg:sample:gammajets_strong_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:samp