{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-cc9ca41a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Ratio of Higgs boson coupling modifiers (lambda_ij)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the Ratio of Higgs boson coupling modifiers (lambda_ij):\n\n1. **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n2. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n3. **2404.06204**: Fiducial cross-section ratios extrapolated to CMS phase space (Table 12)\n4. **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\n5. **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\n6. **2602.18611**: Effective coupling modifier fit assuming no additional BSM decays\n7. **2602.18611**: Effective coupling modifier fit with \\( B_{\\text{inv}} \\), \\( B_{\\text{undet}} \\) floating and \\( |\\kappa_V| \\leq 1 \\) constraint\n8. **2602.18611**: Coupling modifier ratio fit\n9. **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n10. **2604.27044**: Combined Run 3 resolved+merged \\( HH \\rightarrow 4b \\) result\n11. **2604.27044**: Combined Run 2 + Run 3 \\( HH \\rightarrow 4b \\) result\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson decays, production cross sections, and effective field theory interpretations.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2302.05225", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Ratio of Higgs boson coupling modifiers (lambda_ij)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.437}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 81, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3", "hepkg:result:combined-run3", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:coupling_modifier_ratios", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_bsm0", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_binv_kv1", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:cms-fiducial-xsec-ratio-table12", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "hepkg:observable:acceptance_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cb-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cw-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cw-tilde-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cwww-observable", "hepkg:observable:atgc-cwww-tilde-observable", "hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "hepkg:observable:bsm_branching_fraction_invisible", "hepkg:observable:cms-fiducial-xsec-ratio", "hepkg:observable:coupling_e_tau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "hepkg:observable:coupling_mu_tau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_symmetry_leptonquark", "hepkg:observable:coupling_symmetry_updown", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "hepkg:observable:eft_coefficient_constraints", "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_no_dihiggs", "hepkg:observabl