{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-cd4c98e8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Top quark background (tṫ̄, single top)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the top quark background (including both \\( t\\bar{t} \\) and single top):\n\n1. **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n2. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n3. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n4. **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n5. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n6. **2405.18661**: CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement.\n7. **2405.18661**: CMS \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) associated production cross section measurement.\n8. **2405.18661**: CMS four top quark (tttt) production measurement.\n9. **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV.\n10. **2510.07527**: HH→bb tautau analysis result.\n11. **2510.07527**: HH→bbWW, WW→4q all-hadronic analysis result.\n12. **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n13. **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state.\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including top quark pair production, single top quark production, and associated production with other particles. Each of these analyses estimates the top quark background to varying degrees of detail and in different contexts.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Top quark background", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 54, "error": null, "seconds": 0.273}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 95, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:fourtop_measurement", "hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404"]}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:bbtautau_qcd_multijet", "