{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-cd57fcfe", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 3L MisID e/mu control region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"3L MisID e/mu control region\":\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n\nThese analyses are the ones that define the region \"3L MisID e/mu control region\" according to the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2008.0592