{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-d4b75230", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $Wt$ single-top background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "25 analyses estimate the $Wt$ single-top background. Here are some of the specific analyses:\n\n1. **CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec`)\n2. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8`)\n3. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556`)\n4. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044`)\n5. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19`)\n6. **HH->WWgamgam analysis result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:wwgamgam`)\n7. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77`)\n8. **Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee`)\n9. **Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a`)\n10. **Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $W$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5`)\n11. **Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e`)\n12. **Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ TeV and $13$ TeV** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339`)\n13. **Search for a new neutral gauge boson", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2308.02285", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Wt single-top", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.325}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 38, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:multijet_tchannel", "hepkg:background:other-minor-backgrounds", "hepkg:background:rare-sm", "hepkg:background:single-top", "hepkg:background:single_top", "hepkg:background:single_top_background", "hepkg:background:singleh", "hepkg:background:singletop", "hepkg:background:top", "hepkg:background:top-quark", "hepkg:background:top-singlelepton", "hepkg:background:top_quark", "hepkg:background:ttbar"