{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-d7175651", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the generator GoSam + MiNLO?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the generator GoSam + MiNLO:\n\n- 2004.04545\n- 2106.01676\n- 2107.12553\n- 2109.13808\n- 2112.03161\n- 2202.08676\n- 2208.12095\n- 2209.07327\n- 2211.08028\n- 2303.15340\n\nThese papers include various processes and samples, such as $t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $t\\bar{t}V$, and $Z/\\gamma^*$ (Z+jets) simulations.\n\nTo provide a more detailed breakdown, I will list the specific samples and processes used in each paper:\n\n- **2004.04545**: $t\\bar{t}H$/$tH$ NLO signal MC samples, $t\\bar{t}\\gamma\\gamma$ simulated background sample\n- **2106.01676**: $Z/\\gamma^*$ (Z+jets) MC sample, $t\\bar{t}$ MC sample\n- **2107.12553**: Simulated SM $t\\bar{t}$ sample\n- **2109.13808**: $t\\bar{t}$ pair-production sample\n- **2112.03161**: $t\\bar{t}V$ (ttW, ttZ) MC sample, $t\\bar{t}$ production MC sample\n- **2202.08676**: $t\\bar{t}$ MC simulation sample\n- **2208.12095**: $t\\bar{t}V$ MC sample, $tWZ$ and $tZ$ MC sample\n- **2209.07327**: $t\\bar{t}$ production sample, $ttW$ production sample\n- **2211.08028**: $t\\bar{t}$ background MC sample\n- **2303.15340**: $t\\bar{t}$ MadGraph5_aMC@NLO+Pythia 8.230 sample, $t\\bar{t}W$ and $t\\bar{t}Z$ MadGraph5_aMC@NLO+Pythia 8.210 samples, $t\\bar{t}H$ MadGraph5_aMC@NLO sample\n\nThese papers cover a range of processes and final states, demonstrating the versatility of the GoSam + MiNLO generator in simulating various high-energy physics scenarios.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "210