{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-d8203b7d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Free-floating normalization constrained by dedicated control regions in the fit?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using the method \"Free-floating normalization constrained by dedicated control regions in the fit\":\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets background and $W$+jets background.\n- **2007.02873**: Estimates Z+jets background.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets background (Z→νν) and W+jets background.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates W+jets background and Z+jets background.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ background.\n- **2106.01676**: Uses Z+jets MC sample, estimates SM WZ background (three real prompt leptons), and Z+jets (FNP-lepton) background.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets background (primarily Z->tautau) and non-resonant WW diboson background.\n- **2110.11231**: Estimates VVV triboson background.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $W{+}\\text{jets}$ background and $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates W+jets background and Z+jets background.\n- **2307.01094**: Estimates $WZ$ + jets background.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background and Z+jets (or virtual photon) background.\n- **2312.04450**: Estimates $Z$+jets background ($Z+b$, $Z+c$, $Z+l$), $WZ$+jets background ($WZ+b$, $WZ+c$, $WZ+l$), and $ZZ$+jets background ($ZZ+b$, $ZZ+c$, $ZZ+l$).\n\nThese analyses use the specified method for estimating backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "20