{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-db7be6c9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Data-driven normalization from control region fit (CR_ttbar), simultaneous with signal region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using a data-driven normalization from control region fit (CR_ttbar), simultaneous with the signal region:\n\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{Te\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Data-driven normalization from control region fit (CR_ttbar), simultaneous with signal region", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.485}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_method", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 146, "error": null, "seconds": 0.05}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:others-minor", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:vvv", "hepkg:background:wjets", "hepkg:background:ww", "hepkg:background:www", "hepkg:background:wz-jets", "hepkg:background:wz", "hepkg:background:wz-plus-jets", "hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:z-plus-jets", "hepkg:process:znunu-jets-background", "hepkg:sample:zjets", "hepkg:background:zjets"], "predicate": "background_uses_method"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}, {"round": 4, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_ids": ["h