{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-dc287533", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Particle-level (dressed) muon?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Particle-level (dressed) muon\":\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2109.13808**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson properties using $WW^{*}(\\rightarrow e\\nu\\mu\\nu)jj$ production in $36.1\\text{\\,}{\\mathrm{fb}}^{-1}$ of $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2503.19420**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2504.13081**: \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n\nThese analyses define the object \"Particle-level (dressed) muon\" and use it in their respective studies.", "answered": true, "papers":