{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-dcf38d61", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured ΔR of the bb^add. pair?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the observable ΔR of the bb^add. pair:\n\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2401.05299**: Fiducial \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) cross-section measurement result.\n- **2401.07090**: Differential branching fraction measurement of \\( B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ \\mu^+ \\mu^- \\) across 15 \\( q^2 \\) bins.\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2404.06204**: Fiducial cross-section ratios extrapolated to CMS phase space (Table 12).\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that have results measuring the observable ΔR of the bb^add. pair.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses measured the observable ΔR of the bb^add. pair:\\n\\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b} \\\\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\\\bar{t}b\\\\bar{b} \\\\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\, \\\\text{TeV} \\\\).\\n- **2401.05299**: Fiducial \\( t\\\\bar{t}W \\\\) cross-section measurement result.\\n- **2401.07090**: Differential branching fraction measurement of \\( B^+ \\\\rightarrow K^+ \\\\mu^+ \\\\mu^- \\\\) across 15 \\( q^2 \\\\) bins.\\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\\\) collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\, \\\\text{TeV} \\\\).\\n- **2404.06204**: Fiducial cross-section ratios extrapolated to CMS phase space (Table 12).\\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\, \\\\text{TeV} \\\\).\\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2207.12246", "2302.05225", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ΔR of the bb^add. pair", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.319}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 71, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:r-ttw-ratio", "hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:diff_bf_bp_k_mumu", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:electron_sin