{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-df2ab1ab", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Barlow-Beeston lite approach for MC statistical uncertainties in simulated templates?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records that the analysis in the paper \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\" (arXiv: 2602.18611) estimates a background using the Barlow-Beeston lite approach for MC statistical uncertainties in simulated templates.\n\nThis is the only analysis in the graph that uses this method for estimating backgrounds.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Barlow-Beeston lite", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.266}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_method", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.005}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:simulated_template_backgrounds"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}, {"round": 4, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_ids": ["hepkg:background:simulated_template_backgrounds"]}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}, {"round": 5, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8"]}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:method:barlow_beeston_lite"]}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:simulated_template_backgrounds", "hepkg:method:barlow_beeston_lite", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1e0e17a8fd34810ea5fd132b", "hepkg:evidence:4613247f187f4f4eea60c794"], "seen_values": ["13", "2602.18611", "80002", "and", "approach", "background", "background_method", "background_uses_method", "barlow-beeston", "boson", "collisions", "combined", "contributions", "decay", "derived", "for", "from", "hepkg:assertion:4f36e1988411f7ae662b13c8", "hepkg:assertion:c444af9048ded25239a66773", "hepkg:background:simulated_template_backgrounds", "hepkg:method:barlow_beeston_lite", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "higgs", "histogram", "hskip-0", "interpretations", "lite", "measurements", "modeled", "production", "proton-proton", "ptv", "result", "result_estimates_background", "simulated", "simulation", "sqrt", "statistical", "templates", "text", "uncertainties", "via"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 6, "prompt_tokens": 22255, "completion_tokens": 291, "rounds": 6, "seconds": 8.97147744614631, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 8.97147744614631, "llm_calls": 6.0, "tokens": 22546.0, "rounds": 6.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "entity_retrieved": 1.0, "entities_seen": 3.0, "tool_calls": 5.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 3.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-dfe8503a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ background:\n\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2103.06956**: Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${W}{Z}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${p}{p}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$.\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $W$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{*}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$.\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$.\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Z/gamma*+jets", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 28, "error": null, "seconds": 0.297}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 59, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044