{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-e3249812", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Rare electroweak (EW) backgrounds: WZ, triboson (ZZZ, WZZ, WWZ), ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background from rare electroweak (EW) backgrounds such as WZ, triboson (ZZZ, WZZ, WWZ), ttZ, ttWW, and ttZZ:\n\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential WZ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at √s=13 TeV.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in pp→t̄t production at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of t̄tZ production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS tt̄+Z0 (ttZ) associated production cross section measurement.\n- **2405.18661**: CMS tt̄+W (ttW) associated production cross section measurement.\n- **2510.07527**: HH→bbWW, WW→4q all-hadronic analysis result.\n- **2510.07527**: HH→multilepton analysis result.\n- **2510.07527**: HH→bbZZ(4l) analysis result.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4b final state.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Rare electroweak (EW) backgrounds: WZ, triboson (ZZZ, WZZ, WWZ), ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.519}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 97, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:ttw_measurement", "hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:bbzz", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbww4q_top_vector_boson", "hepkg:background:bbzz_zplusx", "hepkg:background:combinatorial-background", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson-2lOS", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:ew-singlelepton", "hepkg:background:flavor_symmetric", "hepkg:background:fnp-lepton-rjr", "hepkg:background:minor-rare-backgrounds", "hepkg:background:multiboson", "hepkg:background:multiboson-3l", "hepkg:background:multiboson_prompt", "hepkg:background:multilepton_diboson", "hepkg:background:mw_background", "hepkg:background:nonprompt-lepton", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_lepton", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_wz_ttz", "hepkg:background:other", "hepkg:background:other-minor-backgrounds", "hepkg:background:other-sm-minor", "hepkg:background:other-subdominant", "hepkg:background:others", "hepkg:background:rare", "hepkg:background:rare-proces