{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-e4351428", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the generator Hj-MiNLO prescription?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the generator Hj-MiNLO prescription:\n\n- **2007.02873**: Used `qq→WH` and `qq→ZH` signal MC samples.\n- **2009.04363**: Used `ggH` signal MC sample.\n- **2103.04956**: Used `ggH`, `VBF`, and `qqbar->VH` POWHEG 2.0 NLO signal MC samples, as well as `gg->ZH` and `bbH` JHUGen 7.3.0 LO signal MC samples.\n- **2109.13808**: Used `qqbar->WH,ZH` associated-production sample.\n- **2111.08340**: Used `gg→H→bḇ (ggF)` and `qq→VH` signal MC samples.\n- **2202.08676**: Used `SM Higgs boson production` MC simulation sample.\n- **2205.05120**: Used `ggH` signal sample generated with JHUGen at LO.\n- **2206.09466**: Used `ggH` and `Quark-induced ZH` signal MC samples.\n- **2207.00348**: Used `VBF` signal MC sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8.2).\n- **2304.08962**: Used `Signal di-charmonium resonance` MC sample.\n- **2405.18661**: Used `POWHEG v2 + MiNNLO DY` simulation for sin2(theta_eff) extraction.\n- **2503.19420**: Used `$q\\bar{q}\\to WH$ and $q\\bar{q}\\to ZH$ simulated samples.\n- **2605.14245**: Used `VBF and VH SM and anomalous-coupling samples (JHUGen LO)`, `ggH+2 jets SM and anomalous-coupling samples (POWHEG+MiNLO NLO)`, `WH resonant-background sample (JHUGen)`, and `VBF, ZH and WH SM and BSM samples (JHUGen LO QCD)`.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the Hj-MiNLO prescription in their analyses.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2103.04956", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2304.08962", "2309.14442", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": 