{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-e58ce82e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $W$+jets background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the \\( W \\)+jets background:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2107.12553**: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\( W \\) bosons using 137 \\( \\, \\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2511.11853**: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state.\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including searches for new particles, measurements of Higgs boson properties, and studies of top quark production. Each of these analyses explicitly estimates the \\( W \\)+jets background as part of their analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "W+jets", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.245}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 43, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hep