{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-e5c8a3be", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 2ℓ SS Signal Region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"2ℓ SS Signal Region\":\n\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese analyses are the ones that define the \"2ℓ SS Signal Region\" according to the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "2ℓ SS Signal Region", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.338}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 63, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-fiducial", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-sr", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-sr", "hepkg:region:4l-2sfos-sr", "hepkg:region:SR-DM_pseudoscalar", "hepkg:region:SR-DM_scalar", "hepkg:region:SR-bWN", "hepkg:region:SR-bffN_btag", "hepkg:region:SR-bffN_softb", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_diag_high", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_diag_low", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_high", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_med", "hepkg:region:SRS", "hepkg:region:bbgamga