{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-e5fab80d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Smoothly falling m_gamma-gamma continuum background (final signal-extraction fit)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background \"Smoothly falling m_gamma-gamma continuum background (final signal-extraction fit)\" or similar backgrounds:\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2103.06956**: \"Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n3. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n4. **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n5. **2207.00348**: \"Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139\\,\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\"\n6. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n7. **2308.02285**: \"Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n8. **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n9. **2408.03744**: \"Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\"\n10. **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{*}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n11. **2510.07527**: \"HH->bb gamgam analysis result\"\n12. **2510.07527**: \"HH->gamgamtautau analysis result\"\n13. **2510.07527**: \"HH->WWgamgam analysis result\"\n14. **2602.18611**: \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n15. **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state\"\n16. **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n\nThese", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Smoothly falling m_gamma-gamma continuum background (final signal-extraction fit)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 33, "error": null, "seconds": 0.4}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 57, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:wwgam