lisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\n\nThese papers define the $t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$) in their respective analyses.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "t tbar control region CR_t tbar", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.368}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 49, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55486f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c", "hepkg:result:1b05d75dca9cf140bac022d5"]}, "rows": 0, "error": "unknown_entity_id", "seconds": 0.0}, {"round": 4, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", 