{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-e844fdcb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Simplified SUSY model of wino-like chargino-neutralino production with χ1±→Wχ10, χ20→Hχ10?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 14 distinct analyses that measured the Simplified SUSY model of wino-like chargino-neutralino production with \\( \\chi1^\\pm \\rightarrow W \\chi1^0 \\), \\( \\chi2^0 \\rightarrow H \\chi1^0 \\). Here are the specific papers and results:\n\n1. **General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Result: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\n2. **Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Result: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\n3. **Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Result: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n\n4. **Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\( \\mathup{{W}} \\) bosons using 137 \\( \\, \\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Result: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\( \\mathup{{W}} \\) bosons using 137 \\( \\, \\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\n5. **Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Result: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\n\n6. **Search for displaced leptons in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Result: Search for displaced leptons in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\n\n7. **Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Result: Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\n8. **Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)**:\n   - Result: Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\nThese analyses cover a range of final states and methods, providing comprehensive coverage of the model in question.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2405.18661", "2508.13900", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Simplified SUSY model of wino-like chargino-neutralino production with χ1±→Wχ10, χ20→Hχ10", "kind": "bsm_model"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.471}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_targets_model", "object_set": "