{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ea38e27a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Displaced track?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring a displaced track:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Preselection region (m_llj < 250 GeV)\n- **2006.05880**: Control regions CR^Z_ttZ and CR^Z_VV for ttZ and multi-boson background normalisation (3ℓ selection)\n- **2007.02873**: 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- **2009.14537**: Preselection region (opposite-charge same-flavor dilepton, Z-veto, low p_T^ll) and combinatorial background control/mixed-data sample (preselected events with A_phi^ll > 0.01)\n- **2012.01581**: Common dijet/SV preselection region (Table 2)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20) and common baseline selection for three-lepton categories (3ℓA–3ℓF)\n- **2107.12553**: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6) and 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2112.03161**: Dilepton (DL) channel signal region\n- **2207.12246**: Elastic-scattering candidate selection\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu < 11 GeV, ΔR < 0.25\n- **2401.05299**: 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n- **2401.07090**: Electron channel baseline preselection (B+ mass 4.7-5.7 GeV, prior to q^2 binning)\n- **2403.01556**: Generic emerging-jet signal region (>=2 tagged EJs)\n- **2404.06204**: Detector-level signal region for W -> e nu selection and W -> mu nu selection\n- **2503.19420**: 3-lepton Z-dominated signal region\n- **2508.13900**: Common preselection region (all channels), 0L, 0 S-jet category, and 0L, 1 S-jet category\n\nThese analyses cover a wide range of final states and signal regions, each requiring a displaced track as part of their event selection criteria.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Displaced track", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 31, "error": null, "seconds": 0.261}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 104, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:0l-0j", "hepkg:region:0l-1j", "hepkg:region:signal-regions", "hepkg:region:1l-0j", "hepkg:region:1l-1j", "hepkg:region:2l-0j", "hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdom-sr", "hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:combinatorial-control-sample", "hepkg:region:three_lepton_baseline", "hepkg:object:CR-Z-VV", "hepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ", "hepkg:region:w-enu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:w-munu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:dl_search_region", "hepkg:region:elastic_candidate_selection", "hepkg:region:preselection_electron", "hepkg:region:sr-generic"]}, "rows": 28, "error": null, "seconds": 0.017}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object:3d_prompt_track", "hepkg:object:CR-h-ttbar", "hepkg:object:SR-h-1AB", "hepkg:object:VR-Z-ttZ", "hepkg:object:alfa_track", "hepkg:object:btrackjet", "hepkg:objec