{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ebd9e29c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample ggH signal MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"ggH signal MC sample\" or related samples:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample or related samples.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "20