{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ed55606d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using QCD multijet background estimated via data control regions with inverted transverse-mass and isolation requirements?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following papers estimate backgrounds using methods similar to \"QCD multijet background estimated via data control regions with inverted transverse-mass and isolation requirements\":\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$, $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and $t\\bar{t}+Z$ backgrounds.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ and $W$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}+Z$, $W$+jets, and $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}+Z$, and $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2106.01676**: Estimates $WZ$, $t\\bar{t}$, and $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ and $WW$ backgrounds.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates $WZ$ background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $W$+jets and $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$ background.\n\nThese papers cover a range of backgrounds and processes, including $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$, $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, $t\\bar{t}+Z$, $WZ$, and $WW$ backgrounds.\n\nAnswering your question, the graph records the following analyses that estimate a background using methods similar to \"QCD multijet background estimated via data control regions with inverted transverse-mass and isolation requirements\":\n\n- **2004.14060**\n- **2010.14293**\n- **2012.03799**\n- **2102.01444**\n- **2106.01676**\n- **2109.13808**\n- **2202.08676**\n- **2208.12095**\n- **2211.08028**\n- **2308.02285**\n\nThese papers use various data-driven methods to estimate the backgrounds, including control regions with inverted transverse-mass and isolation requirements.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate a background using methods similar to 'QCD multijet background estimated via data control regions with inverted transverse-mass and isolation requirements': 2004.14060, 2010.14293, 2012.03799, 2102.01444, 2106.01676, 2109.13808, 2202.08676, 22", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "QCD multijet background estimated via data control regions with inverted transverse-mass and isolation requirements", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.493}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_method", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 141, "error": null, "seconds": 0.052}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:background_method:qcd-multijet-control-region-method"], "predicate": "background_uses_method"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "seconds": 0.005}, {"round": 4, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_meth