{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ede43b73", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Top quark and vector boson backgrounds (bbWW->4q all-hadronic)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background for Top quark and vector boson backgrounds (bbWW->4q all-hadronic):\n\n1. **CMS four top quark (tttt) production measurement** - Paper: [2405.18661](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.18661)\n2. **CMS ttbar+Z0 (ttZ) associated production cross section measurement** - Paper: [2405.18661](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.18661)\n3. **CMS ttbar+W (ttW) associated production cross section measurement** - Paper: [2405.18661](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.18661)\n4. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector** - Paper: [2111.08340](https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.08340)\n5. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** - Paper: [2205.05120](https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.05120)\n6. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** - Paper: [2208.12095](https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.12095)\n7. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}Z\\) production in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations** - Paper: [2312.04450](https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.04450)\n8. **HH->bb tautau analysis result** - Paper: [2510.07527](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.07527)\n9. **HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result** - Paper: [2510.07527](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.07527)\n10. **HH->bbWW, WW->lvqq/2l2nu analysis result** - Paper: [2510.07527](https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.07527)\n11. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\)** - Paper: [2602.18611](https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.18611)\n12. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\(b\\) final state** - Paper: [2604.27044](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.27044)\n\nThese papers cover a range of analyses that estimate the specified backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Top quark and vector boson backgrounds bbWW->4q all-hadronic", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 53, "error": null, "seconds": 0.451}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 112, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:fourtop_measurement", "hepkg:result:ttw_measurement", "hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:bbww_lvqq_2l2nu", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbbb_resolved_qcd_m