{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ee638a8c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Drell-Yan background MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the Drell-Yan background MC sample:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\).\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the \\(H \\to \\tau \\tau\\) final state.\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp \\to t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\).\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\(b\\) final state.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the \\(H \\to \\tau \\tau\\) final state in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}\\).\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the Drell-Yan background MC sample according to the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109