{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-f32096ee", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample ttH signal MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"ttH signal MC sample\":\n\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H \\to \\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the \"ttH signal MC sample\" according to the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ttH signal MC sample", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.416}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 95, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:sample:bbh-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:bbh_jhugen", "hepkg:sample:bsll-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:drpv_stop_dd_signal_mc", "hepkg:sample:ggf-higgs-hbb", "hepkg:sample:ggh-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:ggh_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ggzh-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:gtt-signal", "hepkg:sample:hh-vbf-lo-madgraph", "hepkg:sample:jetjet_signal_mc", "hepkg:sample:leptoquark_signal", "hepkg:sample:lq-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:rpv_stop_bl_signal_mc", "hepkg:sample:rpv_stop_dl_signal_mc", "hepkg:sampl