{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-f6cc54fd", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Diboson (WW, ZZ, WZ) MC samples?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample Diboson (WW, ZZ, WZ) MC samples:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( \\mathup{{{W}}}\\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( \\mathup{{{p}}}\\mathup{{{p}}} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\; \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) and \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13  TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( \\mathup{{{b}}} \\) final state\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the Diboson (WW, ZZ, WZ) MC samples.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Diboson (WW, ZZ, WZ) MC samples", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.485}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 101, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee"]}, "rows