{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-f76f4c4d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background ZZ irreducible background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the ZZ irreducible background:\n\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2510.07527**: HH->multilepton analysis result\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bbZZ(4l) analysis result\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson production, multilepton probes, and top quark production, among others. Each of these papers includes estimates of the ZZ irreducible background as part of their analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ZZ irreducible background", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.333}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 127, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbzz", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbzz_zplusx", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:diboson_vv", "hepkg:background:dps", "hepkg:background:drell-yan-tautau", "hepkg:background:dy_background", "hepkg:background:fnp", "hepkg:background:gamma-jets", "hepkg:background:multiboson", "hepkg:background:multilepton_diboson", "hepkg:background:nonprompt-lepton", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_lepton", "hepkg:background:other", "hepkg:background:others", "hepkg:background:rare", "hepkg:background:rare-processes", "hepkg:backg