lings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( { \\mathup{{{p}}}}{ \\mathup{{{p}}}} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and \\( 13 \\) TeV\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( \\mathup{{{W}}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2111.08340", "2205.05120", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Validation region VR^{Z,n-jet}_VV for multi-boson background (jet multiplicity extrapolation)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.524}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 45, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:re