{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-f988e82c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Combinatorial background (Drell-Yan and γγ→ℓ+ℓ- lepton pairs paired with an uncorrelated forward proton)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background \"Combinatorial background (Drell-Yan and γγ→ℓ+ℓ- lepton pairs paired with an uncorrelated forward proton)\":\n\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2405.18661**: CMS ttbar+Z0 (ttZ) associated production cross section measurement\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bb tautau analysis result\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bbWW, WW->lvqq/2l2nu analysis result\n- **2510.07527**: HH->multilepton analysis result\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including measurements of cross sections, constraints on anomalous couplings, and searches for new phenomena. Each of these papers estimates the combinatorial background involving Drell-Yan and γγ→ℓ+ℓ- lepton pairs paired with an uncorrelated forward proton.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Combinatorial background (Drell-Yan and γγ→ℓ+ℓ- lepton pairs paired with an uncorrelated forward proton)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 59, "error": null, "seconds": 0.505}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 88, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:bbww_lvqq_2l2nu", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9