{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ff03f084", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Direct estimation of background from MC simulated samples?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using \"Direct estimation of background from MC simulated samples\":\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates backgrounds including $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $t\\bar{t}+Z$.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates the $Z+\\text{jets}$ background.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates backgrounds including $t\\bar{t}$ (semileptonic/dileptonic), $t\\bar{t}+Z(\\to\\nu\\nu)$, and $Z+\\text{jets}$.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates backgrounds including $t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}Z$, $Wt$, and \"Others\" minor background category ($VVV$, $t\\bar{t}t$, $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $t\\bar{t}WW$, $t\\bar{t}WZ$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $tZ$).\n- **2106.01676**: Estimates backgrounds including $Z+\\text{jets}$, $WZ$, and $t\\bar{t}$.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates backgrounds including $Z/\\gamma^*+\\text{jets}$ and non-resonant $WW$ diboson.\n- **2110.11231**: Estimates the $VVV$ triboson background.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates the $WZ$ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates the $Z+\\text{jets}$ background.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates backgrounds including $t\\bar{t}$ and $Z+\\text{jets}$.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates backgrounds including $t\\bar{t}$ and diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ).\n\nThese analyses use the method \"Direct estimation of background from MC simulated samples\" to estimate various backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2