{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ff288268", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region MB/BDT-CRW (W+jets control region)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region MB/BDT-CRW (W+jets control region):\n\n- **2008.05928**: Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\( pp \\) Collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS Detector\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and \\( 13 \\) TeV\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2511.11853**: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\nThese analyses are the ones that define the region MB/BDT-CRW (W+jets control region) in their respective studies.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "MB/BDT-CRW (W+jets control region)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.515}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "hepkg:result:1b05d75dca9cf140bac022d5", "hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:3l-intc-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-matc-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-misid-emu-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-onz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-vv-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-zgamma-cr", "hepkg:region:4l-zz-cr", "hepkg:region:CR_2j", "hepkg:region:CR_2j_ee", "hepkg:region:CR_b_ee", "hepkg:region:CR_b_j_b_ee", "hepkg:region:CR_j", "hepkg:region:CR_j_ee", "hepkg:region:SRS", "hepkg:region:cr-conv", "hepkg:regio