{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ff34fc5a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Dark-matter mediator signal samples (two-body selection interpretation)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"Dark-matter mediator signal samples (two-body selection interpretation)\" or related samples:\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n3. **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n4. **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n5. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n6. **2207.00348**: \"Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139\\,\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\"\n7. **2207.12246**: \"Measurement of the total cross section and $\\rho$-parameter from elastic scattering in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n8. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n9. **2408.03744**: \"Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\mathup{W}$ and $\\mathup{Z}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\"\n10. **2504.13081**: \"Combination a