{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48229", "qid": "gen-retrieval-ffa09796", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty t\\bar{t} modelling (theory) uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 42 distinct analyses that report the systematic uncertainty related to \\( t\\bar{t} \\) modelling (theory) uncertainty.\n\nTo provide more context, here are some of the specific uncertainties included in this count:\n\n- \\( t\\bar{t} \\) modelling (theory) uncertainty\n- \\( t\\bar{t} + Z \\) theory uncertainty\n- Signal theory uncertainty\n- \\( t\\bar{t} \\) modelling uncertainty\n- WW modelling uncertainty\n- W+HF modelling uncertainty\n- \\( tZq \\) modelling uncertainty\n- Signal acceptance theory uncertainty\n- Z+HF modelling uncertainty\n- Pileup modelling uncertainty\n- Single-top theory uncertainty\n- Total cross section theory uncertainty\n- Single-top modelling uncertainty\n- CR-to-SR extrapolation modelling uncertainty\n- \\( t\\bar{t} \\) initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty\n- Diboson modelling uncertainty\n- Z+jets modelling uncertainty\n- \\( t\\bar{t} + Z \\) modelling uncertainty (renormalisation/factorisation scales, ISR/FSR)\n- Signal total cross-section theory uncertainty\n- \\( t\\bar{t} \\) + heavy-flavour modelling uncertainty\n- \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) ME/PS generator-choice modelling uncertainty\n- \\( t\\bar{t} \\) \\( h_{\\mathrm{damp}} \\) parameter uncertainty\n- \\( tWZ \\) modelling uncertainty (DR1 vs DR2 diagram removal)\n- Modelling of material in front of the ECAL uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are reported across 42 different analyses in the graph.\n\nIf you need more detailed information about specific analyses or further breakdowns, please let me know.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The graph record